window.EXAUD={"My uncle works abroad in Japan.": "audio/cau/adb7993036932e6b.mp3", "She wants to study abroad after school.": "audio/cau/c1571a6624b95c87.mp3", "She is an acquaintance, not a close friend.": "audio/cau/c9a76455ff8bf9f5.mp3", "I met an old acquaintance at the market.": "audio/cau/10b5e7b50801900f.mp3", "Work in pairs and act out the dialogue.": "audio/cau/9f80b4a8118b33e2.mp3", "We must act quickly to save water.": "audio/cau/2f2b0156a6f07db9.mp3", "We need to take action to keep our school clean.": "audio/cau/0c8076052760d1f1.mp3", "Lan is very active, and her quick action helped her friend.": "audio/cau/aa0ee4199314c27b.mp3", "My little brother is very active.": "audio/cau/ee888778c322e79a.mp3", "Hoa is active and enjoys every club activity.": "audio/cau/a7bbb816806174db.mp3", "She actively takes part in class.": "audio/cau/3744bd9a9d414fa7.mp3", "We actively help clean the beach.": "audio/cau/886d6508a571df0e.mp3", "We do many fun activities at the weekend.": "audio/cau/996d76bf4c31cea3.mp3", "Mi is very active and loves outdoor activities.": "audio/cau/94fea0819039eaa4.mp3", "Swimming is my favourite activity.": "audio/cau/f1504092a266a13a.mp3", "Hoa is an active girl, and dancing is her best activity.": "audio/cau/3d7dcf03c6c96451.mp3", "My favourite actor is in this film.": "audio/cau/06b4ba8b8b860ab9.mp3", "He wants to be an actor.": "audio/cau/02db092357d325fd.mp3", "Tickets are 50,000 dong for adults.": "audio/cau/acb3b6176262fa6b.mp3", "Children must swim with an adult.": "audio/cau/3a59f4c818a8fe7c.mp3", "Teenagers are moving into adulthood.": "audio/cau/013e9b2c200496e0.mp3", "He kept this habit into adulthood.": "audio/cau/b68f97019ccb106d.mp3", "Hoa is always polite when she talks to adults.": "audio/cau/30f664238e37dbc6.mp3", "Adults need about eight hours of sleep.": "audio/cau/965ef8331141619a.mp3", "The two sisters look alike.": "audio/cau/adc5d16e3a95923c.mp3", "No two people are exactly alike.": "audio/cau/bd46ef9712c752ec.mp3", "We must keep our traditional crafts alive.": "audio/cau/461c910cfd0f1264.mp3", "The old tree is still alive, but that one is dead.": "audio/cau/713514d344b69a38.mp3", "It's almost time for lunch.": "audio/cau/2b8687581cfb164a.mp3", "Nam almost missed the bus; he was nearly late.": "audio/cau/6450f2937d81ad4c.mp3", "She lives alone in a small flat.": "audio/cau/13d2d43093d9ae4b.mp3", "Don't go to the river alone.": "audio/cau/3571f8f1b5688fca.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Mai answered all the questions in the quiz.": "audio/cau/c93d065e33503510.mp3", "Khoa answered \"Yes\" to question 3.": "audio/cau/0f875ac2987d5d20.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "I can't find my pen anywhere.": "audio/cau/90acc3be6d6ac512.mp3", "You can sit anywhere you like.": "audio/cau/8c299a7d60c0fb85.mp3", "Can you tell apart the sounds /b/ and /p/?": "audio/cau/9830d22239b398a2.mp3", "The twins look the same, so I can't tell them apart.": "audio/cau/e371b2b3f4154d90.mp3", "The idea of a picnic is very appealing.": "audio/cau/d3ba308d53ccc5db.mp3", "The cake looks appealing.": "audio/cau/c306325113d90b74.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "Nam hurt his arm while playing football.": "audio/cau/a45155ed323795c8.mp3", "She has long arms and long legs.": "audio/cau/ef9f352a81207060.mp3", "Raise your arms and stretch.": "audio/cau/c2479125cb41a364.mp3", "My left arm is tired, but both arms are strong.": "audio/cau/726ca463d241e911.mp3", "The arrival time of the train is 9 a.m.": "audio/cau/24e0098229460b82.mp3", "We waited for Nam's arrival, and he arrived at noon.": "audio/cau/13362e13e55490f5.mp3", "What time does the bus arrive at school?": "audio/cau/6222580dc0b6be13.mp3", "We arrived in Da Nang at night; our arrival was late.": "audio/cau/12e29a0ec6a17bbc.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Nam asked his teacher a question.": "audio/cau/4879a0b703b8484f.mp3", "Mi asks a lot of questions; yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/1884bf7fdb16c86c.mp3", "Lan is asking her mother about dinner.": "audio/cau/28eda1c06b5eacae.mp3", "Nam asks a lot, and now he is asking again.": "audio/cau/c563c3f4819710c9.mp3", "Minh asks his friend for a pen.": "audio/cau/463760cf3bb33508.mp3", "Hoa often asks questions, and yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/99ce048ae007844f.mp3", "The shop assistant is very friendly.": "audio/cau/a154f19326268e60.mp3", "My phone has a voice assistant.": "audio/cau/4c4e5412c0038e10.mp3", "I ate a lot of fruit and vegetables.": "audio/cau/940ee80e6c557a64.mp3", "Mai ate a bowl of pho this morning.": "audio/cau/984beb7aa48d94c7.mp3", "He passed the test on his first attempt.": "audio/cau/915d7d5bf914a531.mp3", "She attempted to climb the tree.": "audio/cau/b6e3d6387089c847.mp3", "They attempted to cross the river.": "audio/cau/3ffee5e5b9518304.mp3", "I attempted all the questions.": "audio/cau/5a778a2adf5eaaea.mp3", "Beautiful beaches attract many tourists.": "audio/cau/4c43d9d7afbbf365.mp3", "Ha Long Bay attracts visitors because it is a famous attraction.": "audio/cau/aeb486068ea88223.mp3", "Hoan Kiem Lake is a popular attraction.": "audio/cau/94088e7e8cf750d8.mp3", "The night market attracts tourists and is a big attraction.": "audio/cau/5a512b8768f85428.mp3", "The city is attractive to young people.": "audio/cau/e65fd9dfdd0db098.mp3", "Bright lights attract visitors and make the street attractive.": "audio/cau/8bfc9fecd3006205.mp3", "Who is the author of this book?": "audio/cau/307f149b72d48019.mp3", "To Hoai is a famous author.": "audio/cau/e04eb4b941758460.mp3", "The weather was awful yesterday.": "audio/cau/18c5597f08aedf94.mp3", "What an awful smell!": "audio/cau/96bfd05e078fcb90.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "We play badminton after school.": "audio/cau/0e98f8e245c0b49c.mp3", "My friends and I play badminton in the park every Sunday.": "audio/cau/d96a6cf80411dfaf.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Our team beat them 2–0.": "audio/cau/93f9b7b369c57914.mp3", "My heart beats fast when I run.": "audio/cau/b0625e96716518b4.mp3", "Hoi An is a beautiful old town.": "audio/cau/e98bb193dd75aa2b.mp3", "Lan sings beautifully, and her voice is beautiful.": "audio/cau/4d5c5951771c97b1.mp3", "She sings beautifully.": "audio/cau/d5196d517491e1f4.mp3", "The room is beautifully decorated.": "audio/cau/379b1e778bdefbb9.mp3", "We love the beauty of the countryside.": "audio/cau/b293e5559d039844.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is famous for its beauty; it is really beautiful.": "audio/cau/59dc842a0cb367f8.mp3", "The lesson began at 7 a.m.": "audio/cau/dae32d655f372f80.mp3", "It began to rain.": "audio/cau/965c0e557c3e5414.mp3", "Our lessons begin at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/7e2700abcf553879.mp3", "The film began at 8 p.m. and finished at 10 p.m.": "audio/cau/27d24f5e96b08bae.mp3", "This class is for beginners.": "audio/cau/35a67c99d5b7ec68.mp3", "I am a beginner at chess.": "audio/cau/fe3999a307291b4b.mp3", "At the beginning of the year, we make plans.": "audio/cau/8f5e00d9babf5811.mp3", "Read the beginning of the story and guess the end.": "audio/cau/04bc139456de0bed.mp3", "The festival begins in the evening.": "audio/cau/f06a246366b3175a.mp3", "School begins in September; last year it began on the 5th.": "audio/cau/8157d13dc67e67a5.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is bigger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/5efe9fe286047142.mp3", "My house is big, but Nam's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/44f8b6366001f6da.mp3", "This is the biggest market in the city.": "audio/cau/ba6358ef44b7b295.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the biggest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/815c69dda42327e1.mp3", "I'm a bit tired today.": "audio/cau/42f3919d01ac7e5d.mp3", "Phong is a bit shy, but a little more confident now.": "audio/cau/8a006479d73a2609.mp3", "Exercise is good for your body.": "audio/cau/c752373dc0832e44.mp3", "Draw a person and label the parts of the body.": "audio/cau/136aee3e397e928c.mp3", "She wrote a book about her life.": "audio/cau/428afa8d58f841a3.mp3", "Lan reads a book every week, so she has many books.": "audio/cau/5a4070779479f823.mp3", "I like reading books about animals.": "audio/cau/161e5202b70a9850.mp3", "This book is mine, and those books are Nam's.": "audio/cau/564922fbe3abbd87.mp3", "There is a bookshelf next to my bed.": "audio/cau/28c26e10a15e44bb.mp3", "We have one bookshelf in the living room and two bookshelves upstairs.": "audio/cau/1f773c2cd37855a0.mp3", "Let's meet at the bookshop at three.": "audio/cau/edd3dfa5312f3d80.mp3", "Mi buys books at the bookshop near her school.": "audio/cau/f582ec87c6413bc0.mp3", "My sister is a bookworm; she reads all day.": "audio/cau/c8db770130f6abe1.mp3", "Nam is a bookworm and has hundreds of books.": "audio/cau/8d410197b8c04d62.mp3", "Long speeches bore me.": "audio/cau/8caeb0926b488ee3.mp3", "I don't want to bore you with details.": "audio/cau/0053023504c797f2.mp3", "I'm bored. Let's go out.": "audio/cau/349dce422beb0ca4.mp3", "She gets bored with the same games.": "audio/cau/5538b000e1d9a2cc.mp3", "Reading helps me fight boredom.": "audio/cau/50e83619a7ea3b82.mp3", "He played games out of boredom.": "audio/cau/d68f7ca31f034697.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "There is a cat in the box.": "audio/cau/2e85eeb9526b3b0e.mp3", "Put the toys in the box; we have three boxes.": "audio/cau/94612872a7e7c8fc.mp3", "The toys are in the boxes.": "audio/cau/170d9e1f4536be5e.mp3", "Mai puts her books in two boxes.": "audio/cau/895f5119e1e2f239.mp3", "We play games at break time.": "audio/cau/d7be6e5b8ac32945.mp3", "Be careful not to break the cup; Nam broke one yesterday.": "audio/cau/cb188b00dfe78e80.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "My bike is broken.": "audio/cau/b25995551405e15b.mp3", "Be careful with the broken glass.": "audio/cau/67b6f7828c3ee823.mp3", "She brought a cake to the party.": "audio/cau/4c498283c3f41d5f.mp3", "I brought my umbrella today.": "audio/cau/3183089802d63874.mp3", "I go to school by bus.": "audio/cau/95f45bf1658e850f.mp3", "Lan takes the bus because the buses are cheap.": "audio/cau/362c3212b1a0dbc6.mp3", "The buses are crowded in the morning.": "audio/cau/4fa37117ae1e3e0c.mp3", "This bus is new, but the other buses are old.": "audio/cau/f4d42669f06842ed.mp3", "Everyone is busily preparing for Tet.": "audio/cau/1c1351fcc2fbcb4d.mp3", "She was busily writing.": "audio/cau/8e4c80c34f09a8b6.mp3", "Her family runs a small business in Hue.": "audio/cau/5535eee598660a8f.mp3", "He started a business and now he is a businessman.": "audio/cau/0fd271a26ee50825.mp3", "My uncle is a successful businessman.": "audio/cau/f0ac2a2960c3b45f.mp3", "Many businessmen and businesswomen came to the meeting.": "audio/cau/843f693ed8691d3e.mp3", "My aunt is a successful businesswoman.": "audio/cau/969a25840998f6db.mp3", "The businesswoman travels a lot.": "audio/cau/72e3e47ef97bff41.mp3", "I love the bustle of the city.": "audio/cau/553001dd7b5e719d.mp3", "The village is far from the hustle and bustle.": "audio/cau/12345267b7ca6d66.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is a bustling city.": "audio/cau/3597bb53664f0dd1.mp3", "The market is bustling, but my street is quiet.": "audio/cau/f2c456603c67155d.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "My village is calm and green.": "audio/cau/bc7c091bd908318d.mp3", "The streets are calm and quiet at night.": "audio/cau/2a74b9e92030e5a3.mp3", "She answered calmly.": "audio/cau/c0bc67ad5450e5d5.mp3", "Walk out calmly when there is a fire.": "audio/cau/fad079b435374c70.mp3", "I admire his calmness.": "audio/cau/005245e1abe4ac55.mp3", "Yoga brings calmness.": "audio/cau/68f38a4c896ebb4a.mp3", "The first iPhone came in 2007.": "audio/cau/b74af45c313ce91a.mp3", "Lan came to my house, and then we went to the park.": "audio/cau/db2ce9de70166e15.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "Old people in my village need special care.": "audio/cau/e2b32589dc4d57eb.mp3", "Lan takes care of her little brother very carefully.": "audio/cau/0449e85740a5edad.mp3", "Be careful when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/7d44eca76d25a07d.mp3", "Nam is careful, so he writes carefully.": "audio/cau/3961f897eee5f47e.mp3", "Listen carefully and repeat after me.": "audio/cau/ad3f1bf6d7562211.mp3", "Mi is careful, so she always writes carefully.": "audio/cau/6be5befe9f5467c7.mp3", "Don't be careless with fire.": "audio/cau/3fa8f5ce401f56eb.mp3", "He made a careless mistake.": "audio/cau/0e576f1b557d8217.mp3", "He drives carelessly.": "audio/cau/0042728a9cbcae0d.mp3", "She carelessly left the door open.": "audio/cau/72fb5e9acc250bb9.mp3", "My grandmother is kind and caring.": "audio/cau/a03423bedfa41d41.mp3", "Hoa is caring. She takes care of her little sister.": "audio/cau/7cc44adf2286a858.mp3", "They carried out a study about city life.": "audio/cau/741e882cd91f0aed.mp3", "The old buses carried many passengers.": "audio/cau/1d29e18f669abb89.mp3", "Put the cat in the carrier.": "audio/cau/0d2221276a0a0ac3.mp3", "The mail carrier comes every morning.": "audio/cau/fb9a3cbe383ebc8b.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "I watch cartoons on Sunday mornings.": "audio/cau/41a799be9617591a.mp3", "Cartoons make children laugh.": "audio/cau/db5cecd02de5d7a8.mp3", "If you don't wear a coat, you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/5bc93b2b49391970.mp3", "Hoa often catches a cold in winter.": "audio/cau/d048751371e6aeb4.mp3", "Be cautious when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/9dd111c2f2e4c687.mp3", "She is a cautious driver.": "audio/cau/b817922787a617d7.mp3", "One good teacher can change your life.": "audio/cau/a24566287e5a310e.mp3", "The city changed a lot, and the change is good.": "audio/cau/c2d3e45906274d36.mp3", "The weather in spring is changeable.": "audio/cau/da8f6cf3533cf6e8.mp3", "His mood is very changeable.": "audio/cau/d761822654a22f3f.mp3", "The trip changed her ideas about life.": "audio/cau/da028a9e62cf7a21.mp3", "My village changed after the new road was built.": "audio/cau/f31b9b1d46f2277f.mp3", "There are many changes in my hometown.": "audio/cau/5842dc08b691ba71.mp3", "Our town has made big changes, like new parks.": "audio/cau/d966270acb3214fd.mp3", "Tấm is the main character in the story.": "audio/cau/809b3508d2cedfc9.mp3", "She has a kind character.": "audio/cau/33ae03fcd7ecd7ad.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "My sister is very chatty.": "audio/cau/276b5f54d77e4429.mp3", "The chatty boy has many friends.": "audio/cau/40b44064047e81db.mp3", "Mi checked her work, and the check took ten minutes.": "audio/cau/53e04ae5ad0ce9eb.mp3", "I like bread with cheese.": "audio/cau/904193d5418b0673.mp3", "Pizza has a lot of cheese.": "audio/cau/8f0013195cc5b409.mp3", "My dad and I play chess after dinner.": "audio/cau/4f2bb6111c435c3a.mp3", "Chess helps you think carefully.": "audio/cau/2454b84b223cb946.mp3", "Every child in the village goes to school.": "audio/cau/9f966cc92f3b2d70.mp3", "When he was a child, he lived with his grandparents.": "audio/cau/5f1982ddb057760f.mp3", "I had a happy childhood in the countryside.": "audio/cau/29493d8d0469345f.mp3", "This song reminds me of my childhood.": "audio/cau/a5f0b56f6286f10d.mp3", "Don't be childish; say sorry.": "audio/cau/3e2e6a125ca40003.mp3", "That is a childish game.": "audio/cau/acd7fb585862d0ca.mp3", "She has three children and two grandchildren.": "audio/cau/41e17d5597e264f0.mp3", "One child was quiet, but the other children were noisy.": "audio/cau/863bff50c6e9f303.mp3", "You have a choice of tea or juice.": "audio/cau/d83c640d99d55e18.mp3", "I think you made a good choice.": "audio/cau/89c0a3eddbcb6efd.mp3", "Choose the correct answer.": "audio/cau/9bb3b69b3f099527.mp3", "Mi chose a red pen. It was a good choice.": "audio/cau/4fabb83c5ec962f5.mp3", "I chose the bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/9c85ffa2fb7223db.mp3", "You can choose one, and Nam chose the red one.": "audio/cau/3684e06d8810f79f.mp3", "She was chosen as class monitor.": "audio/cau/77ca45b3c93c0c06.mp3", "Have you chosen a book yet?": "audio/cau/69586b45796a6e5b.mp3", "Big cities often have traffic jams.": "audio/cau/290573a9de9b8727.mp3", "Ha Noi is a city, and Hue is a city too.": "audio/cau/723b5f4c4ced8460.mp3", "Every citizen should obey the law.": "audio/cau/ea7f4c7f2b1f7427.mp3", "He is a Vietnamese citizen.": "audio/cau/e80d176ec8a69643.mp3", "I live in a big city.": "audio/cau/66e0022bec290560.mp3", "Life in the city is busier than in the countryside.": "audio/cau/ec0678a3bad99639.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "My classmates are very friendly.": "audio/cau/70f1668056519f2a.mp3", "Mi has one best friend and many classmates.": "audio/cau/203c4230a4c5b99f.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Close your lips, then open them to say /b/.": "audio/cau/1c12f29d1557a6a6.mp3", "Please close the window; it's cold.": "audio/cau/20e2820b500dbcb2.mp3", "The shop is closed on Sunday.": "audio/cau/25be86170d7d0635.mp3", "Keep the door closed, please.": "audio/cau/31c537b90fc850d5.mp3", "Listen closely to the teacher.": "audio/cau/097906075ef96b43.mp3", "Look closely at the picture.": "audio/cau/991f23146cb2eaee.mp3", "I came down with a cold last week.": "audio/cau/6589d8d2056f15e9.mp3", "It is cold in Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/6af5e5587fe6cf7a.mp3", "I can feel the coldness of the water.": "audio/cau/23d48b220795c5bf.mp3", "Her coldness made him sad.": "audio/cau/681563c4a0ca6a61.mp3", "Please come to my birthday party.": "audio/cau/6800288294234b0b.mp3", "Nam came to school early yesterday.": "audio/cau/e4484967a289b802.mp3", "Success comes from hard work.": "audio/cau/104997cf355813ab.mp3", "Minh comes to school early, but yesterday he came late.": "audio/cau/8fc163a4c3b546e2.mp3", "My new friend is coming to my house.": "audio/cau/364032ec5fb1b2d1.mp3", "Lan came yesterday, and Hoa is coming today.": "audio/cau/2a3f62b0b9c0734e.mp3", "She works for a computer company.": "audio/cau/dbaa7b1a7f381505.mp3", "His company is now a big business.": "audio/cau/8c1460aeda0ca27f.mp3", "Each competitor has three minutes.": "audio/cau/f49ca20c752358d7.mp3", "He is a strong competitor.": "audio/cau/ee643344680b459e.mp3", "There are 20 competitors in the race.": "audio/cau/fd0ca6e78453103e.mp3", "The competitors shook hands.": "audio/cau/27bd090a28af4677.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "The project must be completed by Friday.": "audio/cau/a36434b8b918f435.mp3", "Lan completed her homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/9932d454a78dd897.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "If Mai completes her homework, she can watch TV.": "audio/cau/dafd5e47e20bf7c2.mp3", "Nam always completes his tasks on time.": "audio/cau/bfda491938f14ab7.mp3", "Nam plans his time well to ensure timely completion of his project.": "audio/cau/dc9f46bca5bd24cf.mp3", "After the completion of the test, Hoa felt relaxed.": "audio/cau/8159d955f47b0ba3.mp3", "The rules of the game are complicated.": "audio/cau/ceac2d3cfb0cbdfd.mp3", "Don't make it complicated.": "audio/cau/214fc3b48a1360f3.mp3", "The old house is in bad condition.": "audio/cau/9d9ffa685f510da3.mp3", "You can go out on one condition.": "audio/cau/7b86edfe13e3aa0b.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "The teacher made corrections in red.": "audio/cau/895634813fdf81d2.mp3", "Check your corrections carefully.": "audio/cau/c829f7ab4f978d5b.mp3", "Try to say these new words correctly.": "audio/cau/d4da04af4337ec0f.mp3", "Her answer is correct because she read the question correctly.": "audio/cau/cee1de65a2a9d88f.mp3", "The cost of living in big cities is high.": "audio/cau/5a9760bf5183f656.mp3", "A bus ticket can cost seven thousand dong.": "audio/cau/394dc2917d103de9.mp3", "Travelling abroad is costly.": "audio/cau/3ecac6693c9b43a2.mp3", "The mistake was costly.": "audio/cau/02e469afe966b2c2.mp3", "Viet Nam is a beautiful country.": "audio/cau/df0215608f1e8de4.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside of our country.": "audio/cau/00375e3b63fb00b1.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The city is noisy, but the countryside is quiet.": "audio/cau/37f198fe8e1a722b.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "The plant is dead because I forgot to water it.": "audio/cau/bd6933cd22810bf6.mp3", "My phone battery is dead.": "audio/cau/cb93d3711c2b9485.mp3", "The death of his dog made him sad.": "audio/cau/16557e1350bb02d1.mp3", "Smoking can cause death.": "audio/cau/e5da19be59040040.mp3", "Our departure time is 7 a.m.": "audio/cau/44993d8e0c53e125.mp3", "Check the departure board at the airport.": "audio/cau/43d296018e6feb04.mp3", "Can you describe your house?": "audio/cau/a0d5ad73f19e51bc.mp3", "Describe your friend and read your description to the class.": "audio/cau/5e8b000dcde9e11f.mp3", "Write a short description of your friend.": "audio/cau/1d3f9d3cf060662c.mp3", "Phong describes his school, and his description is funny.": "audio/cau/9801d95651b1cda6.mp3", "Read the descriptions and guess the person.": "audio/cau/20055a561b18e782.mp3", "Mi can describe people well, and her descriptions are fun.": "audio/cau/84984e9d66cc50f9.mp3", "Write a descriptive paragraph about your room.": "audio/cau/053c0911268b28bb.mp3", "Use descriptive words like 'tall' and 'kind'.": "audio/cau/05df1ce0b4bb46d0.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "Customs differ from country to country.": "audio/cau/867f1b35e7b382a9.mp3", "The twins differ in character.": "audio/cau/6fe7387847575daa.mp3", "What is the difference between these pictures?": "audio/cau/6c98c14e1c41bd67.mp3", "Small actions can make a big difference.": "audio/cau/2df232067e45e4a5.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "People think differently.": "audio/cau/f177b3ef34202d8f.mp3", "The word is spelled differently in American English.": "audio/cau/f1593ad480f9bd47.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "I have difficulty in pronouncing this word.": "audio/cau/f0983c29e5893490.mp3", "She solved the problem without difficulty.": "audio/cau/0c8af826fc6c33c1.mp3", "Lan is a diligent student.": "audio/cau/10f7a91fa72fd9c7.mp3", "Vietnamese farmers are very diligent.": "audio/cau/640ace8256f3fb4c.mp3", "It was an important discovery.": "audio/cau/23f9b4c1af7c300b.mp3", "The discovery of fire changed human life.": "audio/cau/d273e705a86eca5f.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "This T-shirt costs ten dollars.": "audio/cau/971b1384b609b99a.mp3", "He saved fifty dollars for a new book.": "audio/cau/b3c227e182f0e05f.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Please close the door when you leave.": "audio/cau/afff0ef664915359.mp3", "Our house has a big front door and a small gate.": "audio/cau/609f4be9be5f1a33.mp3", "Please sit down on the chair.": "audio/cau/08cb6a07df1ed303.mp3", "The cat jumps up and then comes down.": "audio/cau/009acd9ad7b1a705.mp3", "Many people in Da Nang work downtown.": "audio/cau/937a590a251089b9.mp3", "Lan lives downtown, near the city centre market.": "audio/cau/ac4b9b9bb5e89502.mp3", "Can you draw a cat?": "audio/cau/be2932fbc93e80e5.mp3", "Hoa drew a flower and gave me the drawing.": "audio/cau/8ef26c64079b1115.mp3", "Lan's drawing is on the wall.": "audio/cau/e1c99913c9bb1dcf.mp3", "Minh draws well. He drew this drawing yesterday.": "audio/cau/a06a821e60587e14.mp3", "Have you drawn a picture of your family?": "audio/cau/a0d1c0f1a36ef4c7.mp3", "This map was drawn by my brother.": "audio/cau/eaf88a36f69101ec.mp3", "My brother draws pictures of animals.": "audio/cau/f72f002c0ce9c3b5.mp3", "Mi draws every day, and last week she drew a horse.": "audio/cau/c53f78fbfbf3ff78.mp3", "He drew a cat on the board.": "audio/cau/60aeb1a679f13bef.mp3", "We drew pictures in the art lesson.": "audio/cau/cffb3f0aaad7fa4f.mp3", "Life in the countryside can be dull for some teens.": "audio/cau/0347cee2d305ff73.mp3", "The film was dull, but the book was exciting.": "audio/cau/8b56307431aca227.mp3", "The dullness of the film made me sleepy.": "audio/cau/27793bb7a8a4dc46.mp3", "Games can break the dullness of a lesson.": "audio/cau/2b593816f2bca5fd.mp3", "She answered the questions with ease.": "audio/cau/1ed3583b60bd53b0.mp3", "I feel at ease with my friends.": "audio/cau/fec10720b6d9bead.mp3", "Mi makes friends easily at school.": "audio/cau/eedb13c811943ed4.mp3", "The test was easy, so I finished it easily.": "audio/cau/7cb7e2c3342cf293.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "We eat rice every day.": "audio/cau/e1b9f1e0ff973ad1.mp3", "We eat rice today, but yesterday we ate pho.": "audio/cau/575ec69b6a817f1a.mp3", "Have you ever eaten pho?": "audio/cau/b12c38ddea49e537.mp3", "I have eaten breakfast already.": "audio/cau/000f566df66c6c37.mp3", "The bottle is empty.": "audio/cau/91218cfd5cf480c1.mp3", "The streets are empty at night.": "audio/cau/cda748ee10a24d42.mp3", "At the end of the story, he became a hero.": "audio/cau/4cef74a2fd4fb11a.mp3", "We read to the end, and the ending was happy.": "audio/cau/fc827bfa0e26aa94.mp3", "The story has a happy ending.": "audio/cau/a0aee1d6e11c4150.mp3", "The film ends well because it has a happy ending.": "audio/cau/f95c78e65af90c48.mp3", "The desert looks endless.": "audio/cau/d886e868c888b06d.mp3", "I have endless homework this week.": "audio/cau/55076a4decabcf07.mp3", "The lesson ends at eleven o'clock.": "audio/cau/67a17bb93ba6f33d.mp3", "School starts in September and ends in May.": "audio/cau/f8c91dfabd095c7a.mp3", "The soldiers fought the enemy bravely.": "audio/cau/d7e74b5bf24e5f1e.mp3", "The cat is the enemy of the mouse.": "audio/cau/9cbb92de9d0d7660.mp3", "Our PE teacher is very energetic.": "audio/cau/0f20bc2cdf1fdbbc.mp3", "I feel energetic after a good sleep.": "audio/cau/38346e6197dce33e.mp3", "We have English on Monday.": "audio/cau/6e580c9a3bf7deb6.mp3", "Nam wants to study English in England.": "audio/cau/babe058c930ffd1c.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "We had an enjoyable trip to Da Lat.": "audio/cau/fa0dde7e848371c0.mp3", "The English lesson was enjoyable.": "audio/cau/339769385e39a593.mp3", "Reading gives me a lot of enjoyment.": "audio/cau/baba1a4ac12d7cb6.mp3", "He plays the guitar for enjoyment.": "audio/cau/1ffb1fdae1d623a4.mp3", "Can you enlarge this photo?": "audio/cau/f7ea9d85d2ae68b7.mp3", "They plan to enlarge the school library.": "audio/cau/98d58917fdd12ccd.mp3", "I spent the entire day at home.": "audio/cau/edb66e800ba6c4c2.mp3", "The entire class went on the trip.": "audio/cau/f92c63bf4d359ad1.mp3", "He even worked at night to help his family.": "audio/cau/35c426a9236c1cc0.mp3", "It is cold here, even in summer.": "audio/cau/65983b86a05b922c.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "The news excited all the students.": "audio/cau/68587aef43ba8656.mp3", "Football games always excite my brother.": "audio/cau/00b8b1555e60de6d.mp3", "Lan is very excited about the school trip.": "audio/cau/4e01ac39890b7f7f.mp3", "Nam was excited when his friends visited his home.": "audio/cau/5f58aa62d7076582.mp3", "The children shouted with excitement.": "audio/cau/417b6a058ef4f6f8.mp3", "There is a lot of excitement before Tet.": "audio/cau/7418b1921ecb1163.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "The singer found fame at a young age.": "audio/cau/38e4c711b20f4bb0.mp3", "Money and fame don't bring happiness.": "audio/cau/f2341314eb013e00.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its lanterns.": "audio/cau/be0831db3c3bf621.mp3", "General Giap became famous, and his fame spread worldwide.": "audio/cau/4eabd5e77fd10a06.mp3", "We had a fantastic holiday.": "audio/cau/f32cf4ee7488001e.mp3", "The view from the top is fantastic.": "audio/cau/e447250983ededde.mp3", "City life is fast and busy.": "audio/cau/19460b2172566c3b.mp3", "Minh runs fast, but Nam runs faster.": "audio/cau/5811391018cae65d.mp3", "My favourite room is the kitchen.": "audio/cau/7fe9b9a43268f379.mp3", "Football is Nam's favourite sport.": "audio/cau/5418f30ef37044b0.mp3", "I feed my cat twice a day.": "audio/cau/3a8f8f8f00f1daf9.mp3", "Yesterday Lan fed the fish in the pond.": "audio/cau/01b9c59f1a6a6265.mp3", "Grandpa is feeding the chickens now.": "audio/cau/53aec0aca2247225.mp3", "Mi feeds the cat every morning; today she fed it early.": "audio/cau/b5dc31c455add430.mp3", "My feet are cold.": "audio/cau/c3e646029c263253.mp3", "I have two feet, and each foot has five toes.": "audio/cau/54d1b68c58cfc4cb.mp3", "Fill in the gaps with the correct words.": "audio/cau/fdb1b1c53693f72e.mp3", "Mi fills the glass, and now it is full.": "audio/cau/ebdf9cc5c316901a.mp3", "This is the final step of the project.": "audio/cau/4c78d113d199683f.mp3", "Minh finally passed the final test.": "audio/cau/2f8d374f6a4df4c2.mp3", "After a long wait, the bus finally came.": "audio/cau/6bc164c1923107a4.mp3", "First, mix the flour; finally, bake the cake.": "audio/cau/b4b3cc8ebc2b3f7f.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Use the past simple for finished events.": "audio/cau/15e768d53722862d.mp3", "We finished our visual story yesterday.": "audio/cau/da44bbf9abdec66f.mp3", "She can go home early if she finishes her work.": "audio/cau/f322195781186edf.mp3", "Nam finishes school at 4:30 p.m.": "audio/cau/25adb8cccda00edd.mp3", "Minh is finishing his science project now.": "audio/cau/937d910b371dd6d7.mp3", "After finishing her homework, Lan went to bed.": "audio/cau/37fc15713a29f794.mp3", "This bed is too firm for me.": "audio/cau/064e0f85120f1c46.mp3", "My uncle works for a big firm.": "audio/cau/268c7a26eae8f672.mp3", "Firstly, Lan makes a to-do list every evening.": "audio/cau/d1bb0725d0ded095.mp3", "Firstly, we should plan our work ahead.": "audio/cau/41a731569d9018b1.mp3", "We need food and water every day.": "audio/cau/01b6dc39aa643a2b.mp3", "Mum feeds the baby healthy food.": "audio/cau/1407b84140607171.mp3", "I go to school on foot.": "audio/cau/c5716b2592a3d17d.mp3", "Nam stands on one foot, then on both feet.": "audio/cau/76158e9149a2fbb8.mp3", "Phong plays football with his friends.": "audio/cau/9baf509a6408f617.mp3", "Nam likes football and watches it every weekend.": "audio/cau/617a4e3bf9b2e89d.mp3", "English is a foreign language.": "audio/cau/75e39b56b2c2c1a2.mp3", "Many foreign tourists visit Hoi An.": "audio/cau/f8d1768be4c80e9e.mp3", "What do you do in your free time?": "audio/cau/561d82e572a21e67.mp3", "I am busy today, but I am free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/ed0144aa5c166e1b.mp3", "Nothing is more precious than independence and freedom.": "audio/cau/c78680a19317fb70.mp3", "Teenagers want more freedom.": "audio/cau/e07eefd97e88854b.mp3", "Animals move freely in the national park.": "audio/cau/25e7ba19bac40728.mp3", "You can speak freely here.": "audio/cau/7323942bb0641fc5.mp3", "Lan is my good friend.": "audio/cau/dd872f787d0777d3.mp3", "My friend Minh is very friendly.": "audio/cau/4f7040d4f93a465f.mp3", "Tourists love the friendliness of local people.": "audio/cau/a40be7352a7002db.mp3", "Her friendliness makes everyone happy.": "audio/cau/a90e79e9d7f1fffe.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "Our friendship is very important to me.": "audio/cau/01f0404c79a2081f.mp3", "Lan and Hoa are close friends; their friendship is strong.": "audio/cau/9389591d845cf52e.mp3", "Write short notes, not full sentences.": "audio/cau/14bb97e16bb6d06a.mp3", "The bus was full, but the next one was empty.": "audio/cau/cfd981c78ac3d787.mp3", "After a good sleep, Lan is fully alert in class.": "audio/cau/e731cef6fdf5dd54.mp3", "Minh hasn't fully recovered from his cold.": "audio/cau/8cd54850c26f30ee.mp3", "We have fun at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/042795d03f276893.mp3", "The game was fun, and Nam's jokes were funny.": "audio/cau/1343a6a406625409.mp3", "My uncle is very funny.": "audio/cau/3365f3c2b0a43869.mp3", "Phong is funny, so playing with him is fun.": "audio/cau/754492bd17fda5cf.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "We play a game in our English class.": "audio/cau/f89d92956bddd8c5.mp3", "My brother is a gamer, and he loves this game.": "audio/cau/5869b678fdd00fcc.mp3", "My brother is a serious gamer.": "audio/cau/7a29eee205c35813.mp3", "Gamers should take breaks to rest their eyes.": "audio/cau/714192b94227026f.mp3", "Let's meet at the school gate at 7 a.m.": "audio/cau/db65f9078c3fa850.mp3", "There are many motorbikes around the school gates.": "audio/cau/97a6324c5160cac8.mp3", "There are too many vehicles around school gates.": "audio/cau/26cfb3ad666f816d.mp3", "Our school has two gates; the main gate is on Le Loi Street.": "audio/cau/e93a15024024ac1e.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mi goes to school by bike.": "audio/cau/c289e58e0081ccad.mp3", "Nam usually goes swimming, but yesterday he went to the park.": "audio/cau/913dc197023c0f8a.mp3", "We are going to visit Hoi An.": "audio/cau/caf0fb980152def1.mp3", "Lan is going to school now; she goes by bus.": "audio/cau/c4af9d8c2b576c6c.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "My goodness! It's so hot today.": "audio/cau/262b2c15cb0e80ce.mp3", "She helped us out of goodness.": "audio/cau/68406886afe46623.mp3", "I got stuck in a traffic jam and came home late.": "audio/cau/fffb27ec64b971e2.mp3", "Mi usually gets up at six, but today she got up at seven.": "audio/cau/787111ee3d018017.mp3", "I'm grateful to my teachers.": "audio/cau/215960298d6eb11b.mp3", "We are grateful for your help.": "audio/cau/7f07b88037eb59e0.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Your help is greatly appreciated.": "audio/cau/3e7c4dbae7d688f3.mp3", "Technology has greatly changed our lives.": "audio/cau/718fe374663a2930.mp3", "The sky train runs above the ground.": "audio/cau/2e1e5a5f710d21bd.mp3", "The metro runs under the ground, so it is underground.": "audio/cau/912eb0d06b1f0084.mp3", "Each group has four members.": "audio/cau/6db9bb96270db26c.mp3", "Work in groups and report your group's findings.": "audio/cau/dd390edb36c261a2.mp3", "The teacher puts us into groups of five.": "audio/cau/ec8808da410c34e5.mp3", "Our class has six groups, and each group has six students.": "audio/cau/0f693c5a4478ab4f.mp3", "You have grown so tall!": "audio/cau/5aabe598d360154d.mp3", "These apples are grown in Japan.": "audio/cau/17d912f1cd44cf22.mp3", "We have a special guest at our party.": "audio/cau/05de5285bd976b2b.mp3", "The host welcomes each guest at the door.": "audio/cau/96d18dffb9235971.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "I could hardly hear the teacher.": "audio/cau/144fb5f35860f6c9.mp3", "He hardly ever eats vegetables.": "audio/cau/2dbec027597d3ff1.mp3", "Lan is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/5b3ff11d5293f4e5.mp3", "Nam is hardworking, and he never gets lazy.": "audio/cau/06cd2484f9437f49.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "We should not answer hatred with hatred.": "audio/cau/cb3de93e19e75388.mp3", "Hatred can hurt friendships.": "audio/cau/014fc79ff92a660d.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "My little brother has a round head.": "audio/cau/9b2b66e5668763ca.mp3", "Nam has a headache, so his head hurts.": "audio/cau/ae5fd0fd3be2e909.mp3", "I have a headache today.": "audio/cau/2987b56833e3006c.mp3", "Loud music gives me a headache.": "audio/cau/ecc4d3f3e74ef295.mp3", "I can't stand the summer heat.": "audio/cau/0951506113682c1e.mp3", "Mum heats the soup for dinner.": "audio/cau/3552cdcae8f7c77c.mp3", "We turn on the heater in winter.": "audio/cau/97b6d2a218e566ca.mp3", "The water heater is broken.": "audio/cau/3923709391d2f3ac.mp3", "Can you help me with my homework?": "audio/cau/59064ec1f34486d3.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she always helps her mum cook.": "audio/cau/82b6e08d58022ab1.mp3", "A street cleaner is a community helper.": "audio/cau/4e5627311f32688c.mp3", "The helper always helps old people cross the road.": "audio/cau/5d453af4870fad09.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "The shop assistant answered helpfully.": "audio/cau/0b65805c79b864c9.mp3", "She helpfully showed me the way.": "audio/cau/5386979ac33e124d.mp3", "A newborn baby is helpless.": "audio/cau/63bf6644f9f61f8a.mp3", "I felt helpless when I got lost.": "audio/cau/848d3008d4aae72b.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "The cat hid under the bed.": "audio/cau/298f285710fac644.mp3", "I hid the present in my bag.": "audio/cau/07440e0df31ca254.mp3", "Let's play hide-and-seek!": "audio/cau/92bdf95ba8e2006c.mp3", "Where did you hide the key?": "audio/cau/353d0b3791179764.mp3", "Highlight the new words in yellow.": "audio/cau/d498bca60b2480af.mp3", "The highlight of the trip was the cave.": "audio/cau/70cc00f7daf64e62.mp3", "There is a small hill behind my house.": "audio/cau/2785177006dd575d.mp3", "We climbed the hill to see the sunrise.": "audio/cau/39a9da03afb1946f.mp3", "My hobby is collecting stamps.": "audio/cau/51f9ebccb029db6b.mp3", "Nam has many hobbies, and his main interest is music.": "audio/cau/f50e4d89304a6442.mp3", "We visited Hoi An during the summer holiday.": "audio/cau/578987a30e37dfd7.mp3", "Lan went on holiday to Da Lat last year.": "audio/cau/f422a8ac4b914b70.mp3", "Rabbits hop across the field.": "audio/cau/20e44deb05d8f284.mp3", "Can you hop on one leg?": "audio/cau/9cf9571f3128eb84.mp3", "The host asks three teenagers about their lives.": "audio/cau/e9176dc0794241d7.mp3", "The host welcomes each guest to the show.": "audio/cau/5487c29e3fefc14c.mp3", "The hostess welcomed all the guests.": "audio/cau/3381cac8ea85b865.mp3", "She is the hostess of a TV quiz show.": "audio/cau/dec8ce35857b1a76.mp3", "In the hot sun, he is always at the school gate.": "audio/cau/d94f7911dc61672f.mp3", "The heat is terrible today; it's so hot!": "audio/cau/15a129bda3aabffd.mp3", "I do my homework for an hour every evening.": "audio/cau/ada27edeb21f8fa6.mp3", "The bus comes hourly, so we wait an hour.": "audio/cau/3f37385bc8e75b24.mp3", "The bus leaves hourly.": "audio/cau/b60d74f653d3238e.mp3", "There is an hourly news update.": "audio/cau/f0d01c74c30ee817.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "My teacher is very humorous.": "audio/cau/8f6ba9ed4e3a796d.mp3", "I read a humorous story yesterday.": "audio/cau/d81d0caf2c1c6edb.mp3", "Watching TV all day makes you inactive.": "audio/cau/41590c23ceb7a257.mp3", "The volcano has been inactive for years.": "audio/cau/6cfc968444b1c2e9.mp3", "Your homework is incomplete.": "audio/cau/1def1df8007e7413.mp3", "Complete the incomplete sentences.": "audio/cau/865265a2ff56d7b1.mp3", "Correct the incorrect sentences.": "audio/cau/0fa204f88cc856c0.mp3", "Your answer is incorrect, so please correct it.": "audio/cau/2d6a22f249708653.mp3", "He spelled my name incorrectly.": "audio/cau/6f22f1fabc9ff68f.mp3", "If you answer incorrectly, try again.": "audio/cau/8a143b786c81fbef.mp3", "Chess is an indoor game.": "audio/cau/cadc57959ec34895.mp3", "Our school has an indoor swimming pool.": "audio/cau/83a64499cbb9212c.mp3", "It's raining, so let's play indoors.": "audio/cau/04169f48e9b079ef.mp3", "Children spend too much time indoors.": "audio/cau/8fef709df2f5dd51.mp3", "Please inform your parents about the trip.": "audio/cau/13aeeaab5b16b406.mp3", "The radio informs us about the weather.": "audio/cau/11a03146fba546fa.mp3", "Read the information about the summer camp.": "audio/cau/79656cd9cf078d89.mp3", "Our teacher informs us and gives us useful information.": "audio/cau/91b87a5117185e7b.mp3", "This TV programme is very informative.": "audio/cau/8bc42a012462e39b.mp3", "The museum guide was informative.": "audio/cau/3690ade728312b48.mp3", "After 'How about', we use the verb with -ing.": "audio/cau/0b5b2f5d668491cd.mp3", "How about buying a new lamp for your bedroom?": "audio/cau/55a020c7bbf1ac54.mp3", "It's raining. Let's play inside.": "audio/cau/a8fe3fe27e17a1ac.mp3", "Lan opens the door and goes inside.": "audio/cau/1c88017fec65bbcc.mp3", "Music is his greatest interest.": "audio/cau/01ea6b9ecb917ed3.mp3", "Minh has an interest in history, so he is interested in museums.": "audio/cau/218a4f41f5587ba6.mp3", "She was interested in science from an early age.": "audio/cau/34d48dff42b1323f.mp3", "Lan is interested in the book because it is interesting.": "audio/cau/916ab5cb0684d54c.mp3", "City life is interesting but stressful.": "audio/cau/d3da66e08dd099e1.mp3", "The film is interesting, and everyone is interested in it.": "audio/cau/4a91c463480dae58.mp3", "Interview your friends about their hobbies.": "audio/cau/d3665ae8a019b847.mp3", "The interviewer asks questions in the interview.": "audio/cau/17933513ebd68309.mp3", "We interviewed an artisan in our village.": "audio/cau/c459b51d68c47c0f.mp3", "Lan interviewed her grandpa, and the interview was fun.": "audio/cau/7bf3beb59681e5ac.mp3", "The interviewee answered all the questions.": "audio/cau/e3a89b2877a4f3d2.mp3", "Work in pairs: one is the interviewer, one is the interviewee.": "audio/cau/b669d3237b304618.mp3", "The interviewer asked about my hobbies.": "audio/cau/0d6e97a77dcf1c09.mp3", "She works as a TV interviewer.": "audio/cau/b7a7e609de5b577a.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Phu Quoc is a beautiful island.": "audio/cau/f31657f8db0e6c06.mp3", "We took a boat to the island.": "audio/cau/9d8a709859849b19.mp3", "My dad jogs in the park every morning.": "audio/cau/0c370d0cff1d2c1f.mp3", "Let's jog around the lake.": "audio/cau/acb03769f9e45c4a.mp3", "There are many joggers in the park.": "audio/cau/384e5300aacc3ccd.mp3", "My grandpa is an early jogger.": "audio/cau/40ce6284c2bb02a2.mp3", "Lan goes jogging three times a week.": "audio/cau/d6a1e1effa16fe2d.mp3", "My dad goes jogging around Hoan Kiem Lake.": "audio/cau/7990d1d87d0b854e.mp3", "The journey to Sa Pa takes six hours.": "audio/cau/f3e4b822504fb7f1.mp3", "Have a safe journey!": "audio/cau/5af9e1ac6fbaf195.mp3", "Long journeys make me tired.": "audio/cau/e12ff73468165583.mp3", "He wrote about his journeys around Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/5de7c6ee35f8fed5.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "When I was a kid, I lived in the country.": "audio/cau/23662833168fcea2.mp3", "The kid is playing with a ball.": "audio/cau/f4eab8f255a95173.mp3", "It's a perfect present for kids aged between 10 and 15.": "audio/cau/0a1ccb836dfdb1d4.mp3", "The kids play in the park; children love it.": "audio/cau/30844ad30dbeea3e.mp3", "It's only one kilometre from her house.": "audio/cau/22c7954c215e4a53.mp3", "The park is one kilometre away; the lake is two kilometres away.": "audio/cau/b2974a75870e316d.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "She smiled kindly at me.": "audio/cau/1f6770a4e642e4ad.mp3", "He kindly helped the old woman.": "audio/cau/355561eff4531966.mp3", "Thank you for your kindness.": "audio/cau/5a1909574805c9b6.mp3", "Small acts of kindness make people happy.": "audio/cau/591eeb7107114f71.mp3", "Nguyen Hue Street is 1 km from Binh's house.": "audio/cau/227eb730489c05b8.mp3", "The lake is 5 km away, so we go by bus.": "audio/cau/3ab53a0753e4fdbc.mp3", "Do you know his life story?": "audio/cau/db0ea43493818ad0.mp3", "I know her well; I knew her at primary school.": "audio/cau/26baffaf9e8a0ddb.mp3", "Reading books gives us knowledge.": "audio/cau/3868a26411c64bc8.mp3", "He has a good knowledge of history.": "audio/cau/82ba68ba3a00f28e.mp3", "Uncle Ho is known and loved by all Vietnamese people.": "audio/cau/e714527fbec233eb.mp3", "Many people know him; he is well known in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/ea446edd847c7b43.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "The town is largely quiet at night.": "audio/cau/6acff2f7d5971d4e.mp3", "Our success is largely due to teamwork.": "audio/cau/f39589c55d704f4b.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is larger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/34248d77fe6d06a4.mp3", "Ha Noi is large, but Ho Chi Minh City is larger.": "audio/cau/8d6bb314d8a84f29.mp3", "Son Doong is the largest cave in the world.": "audio/cau/e24701bf03dbe79b.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the largest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/846e9ffebe286bac.mp3", "I visited my grandparents last weekend.": "audio/cau/553e8bea75bbdbbd.mp3", "Last Sunday was fun, and next Sunday will be fun too.": "audio/cau/17be93822cc3c397.mp3", "Lastly, turn off the lights.": "audio/cau/317a43523f160ba8.mp3", "Lastly, I want to thank my teachers.": "audio/cau/ed0db063c09f784e.mp3", "Don't be lazy; do your homework.": "audio/cau/e8cd1ea0644d6fc1.mp3", "My cat is lazy and sleeps all day.": "audio/cau/fc1756a55ab83842.mp3", "They wrap com in a lotus leaf.": "audio/cau/aaf35c5642290ae8.mp3", "One leaf fell, then many leaves fell.": "audio/cau/335de96138d28831.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "He had to leave school at the age of fifteen.": "audio/cau/0036ab8cf9a331c5.mp3", "We leave home at six; yesterday we left at seven.": "audio/cau/d3d9e5743a9b9bd0.mp3", "What does Chau say before she leaves?": "audio/cau/b30bd63d9ace5d55.mp3", "They wrap com in two layers of leaves.": "audio/cau/7f5122adae1f0f18.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "I liked the film very much.": "audio/cau/32692a79876886cd.mp3", "When she was young, she liked dolls.": "audio/cau/c63162495cc258a7.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "The liveliness of the market surprised the tourists.": "audio/cau/1f8d1f8c4032f05b.mp3", "I love the liveliness of Tet holiday.": "audio/cau/052386f3749c3787.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "There is a big sofa in the living room.": "audio/cau/85ee341c5ccef3a3.mp3", "We live in a small house with a nice living room.": "audio/cau/a4537e161135cc8a.mp3", "Bat Trang pottery is a famous local product.": "audio/cau/ea08f150b9375ac4.mp3", "Many locals buy food from local farmers at the market.": "audio/cau/dfc3f008f3837ff1.mp3", "We buy vegetables grown locally.": "audio/cau/a3e3351624cf6115.mp3", "This cake is made locally in Hue.": "audio/cau/9156314b93fdb87f.mp3", "Please lock the door when you go out.": "audio/cau/0d4224720f2ab0a5.mp3", "I forgot to lock my bike.": "audio/cau/3eecaee20949f8e4.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Nam looked at the old photos of his village.": "audio/cau/57a1a25de6c14b73.mp3", "She looked tired yesterday, but today she looks happy.": "audio/cau/72e5fb4099eea871.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "There are lots of books in our school library.": "audio/cau/3190c7d803a13870.mp3", "Phong has lots of friends and a lot of free time.": "audio/cau/4a66fae37e042e36.mp3", "The lotus is a symbol of Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/8f542350d632c51d.mp3", "There are many lotus flowers in the pond.": "audio/cau/5af083d65fcb5e99.mp3", "Please don't be loud in the library.": "audio/cau/b4956ef2c49e1b40.mp3", "Nam has a loud voice, and he sings loudly.": "audio/cau/956ffd4ad9cd7167.mp3", "Don't talk loudly in the library.": "audio/cau/6950de8c7d7445c9.mp3", "The baby cried loudly at night.": "audio/cau/7da69b2aed82f71b.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "What a lovely day!": "audio/cau/d4038241635895d6.mp3", "Her little sister is lovely.": "audio/cau/2566ff2d6fc065b2.mp3", "My mother is a loving person.": "audio/cau/5a0aadfbccb5dec1.mp3", "Hoa has a loving family, and she loves them a lot.": "audio/cau/dbfb0082905aad2d.mp3", "Prices are lower in the market.": "audio/cau/dffdbd9c540da76a.mp3", "Please lower your voice.": "audio/cau/10d8c0293fa7c793.mp3", "This shop has the lowest prices.": "audio/cau/f96fb375caf6f8c2.mp3", "January has the lowest temperature.": "audio/cau/b5daae8a7f5ba72e.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "The main problem in the city is traffic.": "audio/cau/5de5106d00321b17.mp3", "The main roads are busy, mainly in the morning.": "audio/cau/8298c8b4a3e2e8a4.mp3", "People here mainly grow rice.": "audio/cau/39ba45d7f9277780.mp3", "I mainly use my phone for study.": "audio/cau/7e14d886ebe6707d.mp3", "Traffic is a major problem in big cities.": "audio/cau/0f5358c82438a060.mp3", "Rice is a major crop in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/322561f4bfe9c225.mp3", "Hoa uses red to mark exam days on her calendar.": "audio/cau/78135abe90fe0ad6.mp3", "Nam marks his due dates with a yellow pen.": "audio/cau/9321f43accfdd88b.mp3", "The teacher writes with a blue marker.": "audio/cau/c0b3142eba8169ac.mp3", "Can I borrow your marker?": "audio/cau/851ae29a54381b90.mp3", "What does 'craft village' mean?": "audio/cau/4c5a16ea9baf9474.mp3", "What do these words mean? Let's check their meaning.": "audio/cau/2a235e867bbba30d.mp3", "Look up the meaning of new words in a dictionary.": "audio/cau/d2030b4713d39b26.mp3", "This gift has a special meaning, so it is meaningful to me.": "audio/cau/d0dcab7ed3224224.mp3", "Helping old people is a meaningful activity.": "audio/cau/d7f05d5006077d20.mp3", "She gave me a meaningful gift.": "audio/cau/846ca5d5159fa816.mp3", "This word is meaningless to me.": "audio/cau/e1260d63109aaff6.mp3", "Life without friends seems meaningless.": "audio/cau/19d8920415da3cb9.mp3", "This is a good method to learn words.": "audio/cau/3c706623138a9ce2.mp3", "Our teacher uses a new method.": "audio/cau/63fd83da91e3b54f.mp3", "There are many methods to save water.": "audio/cau/226f23561a4955df.mp3", "Farmers use modern methods now.": "audio/cau/14bebb2c5f9bc541.mp3", "The pool is 25 metres long.": "audio/cau/a65c0458b422c030.mp3", "Fansipan is 3,143 metres high.": "audio/cau/b2af19148789cb35.mp3", "Ha Noi now has a metro line.": "audio/cau/bd92620d3c8a1fd7.mp3", "The metro is fast, so many people take the metro to work.": "audio/cau/c3507817098f96ed.mp3", "Who Wants to Be a Millionaire is a famous game show.": "audio/cau/65b4ebabaf9980e1.mp3", "He became a millionaire at 30.": "audio/cau/72c925d6692ec873.mp3", "It's only a minor problem.": "audio/cau/84eacb68a176f893.mp3", "He had a minor accident.": "audio/cau/f51fe0ff705346ef.mp3", "Wait a minute, please.": "audio/cau/253cc68d07c9fa9b.mp3", "It takes me fifteen minutes to walk; one minute is sixty seconds.": "audio/cau/875874e3b9240ef0.mp3", "The bus comes every ten minutes.": "audio/cau/f396dbb822ada738.mp3", "Wait a minute; the film starts in five minutes.": "audio/cau/74a1836c371b68d0.mp3", "Fill in the missing words.": "audio/cau/90f5d961b7888ff2.mp3", "My cat has been missing for two days.": "audio/cau/b7971387cc7b6f0f.mp3", "The people in my neighbourhood are mostly friendly.": "audio/cau/54584631f0893d3f.mp3", "We mostly travel by bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/05f1e9640ad3b61c.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "Viet Nam is a nation of 54 ethnic groups.": "audio/cau/fc0377b6b344369a.mp3", "The whole nation celebrates Tet.": "audio/cau/bde6381a94c2d89f.mp3", "She won a national prize in maths.": "audio/cau/6a93b9368e7abe3a.mp3", "Our nation has many national heroes.": "audio/cau/fe097f04f907a2a9.mp3", "What's your nationality? – I'm Vietnamese.": "audio/cau/b014a2963ce2a0a6.mp3", "Students of many nationalities study here.": "audio/cau/69961830c1359fbc.mp3", "The show is broadcast nationally.": "audio/cau/2cb4d46f15de799c.mp3", "She is known nationally as a singer.": "audio/cau/7730eae5a497ae0d.mp3", "There is a big park nearby.": "audio/cau/0bbea8d853e59092.mp3", "My school is near my house, and a market is nearby too.": "audio/cau/b046b21263949e43.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "We need more parks in the city.": "audio/cau/fa790aed3aa20742.mp3", "Plants need water, and Mi needs some help.": "audio/cau/43af483482c3e17f.mp3", "The village needs a new bridge.": "audio/cau/1beac53452ba3355.mp3", "Nam needs a pen, and I need one too.": "audio/cau/bd84b90357a9da88.mp3", "Facebook is a social network.": "audio/cau/b1cd2d40127f3bd1.mp3", "The city has a good bus network.": "audio/cau/645ea1792f411523.mp3", "It was raining. Nevertheless, we went out.": "audio/cau/96e041b73011f4c0.mp3", "The test was hard. Nevertheless, I passed.": "audio/cau/f2dd49917bd958c6.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "My phone is newer than yours.": "audio/cau/b9582550ab411283.mp3", "This building is newer.": "audio/cau/94018b78e01f455f.mp3", "We live in a newly built house.": "audio/cau/966f2a75601347b9.mp3", "The park was newly opened.": "audio/cau/3a8e3879e38476c9.mp3", "I watch the news on TV every evening.": "audio/cau/4eec6079f4f4c6a3.mp3", "The news is good: a new park is open.": "audio/cau/c4024e28c9bf5003.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "Please ask nicely.": "audio/cau/44ab037cea553fcf.mp3", "The room is nicely decorated.": "audio/cau/6eb8998173f66908.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has an exciting nightlife.": "audio/cau/db63b206001cd606.mp3", "The nightlife here is lively, and the streets are busy at night.": "audio/cau/3d60979904eca10a.mp3", "There is too much noise from the traffic.": "audio/cau/618afe734d9580d5.mp3", "The noise is loud, and the street is very noisy.": "audio/cau/71cde03703f63654.mp3", "The children played noisily.": "audio/cau/91ef21d722603a6c.mp3", "Don't eat noisily.": "audio/cau/47c9f7f3b63e2c3f.mp3", "Our street is noisy because of the traffic.": "audio/cau/c625fc467757080e.mp3", "The city is noisy, but my village is quiet.": "audio/cau/63c66e344ab53850.mp3", "We have noodles for breakfast.": "audio/cau/a7f6689578f25801.mp3", "Pho is a kind of Vietnamese noodles.": "audio/cau/c5332454423c2288.mp3", "It's a normal school day.": "audio/cau/08fb09ec5f3aa8ba.mp3", "Is it normal to feel tired?": "audio/cau/047d3b410e06cbb9.mp3", "Ha Noi is in the north of Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/5af5919b198f2d46.mp3", "The wind comes from the north.": "audio/cau/d039649b93012564.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "Make a note of the new words.": "audio/cau/8bdaf02876855cac.mp3", "I write a short note in my notebook.": "audio/cau/3b565057bfcdee58.mp3", "I write new words in my notebook.": "audio/cau/54f4386b8856f178.mp3", "Mi's notebook is full of short notes.": "audio/cau/684bf34705fb9a6b.mp3", "Take notes while you listen.": "audio/cau/a76ebe77aa288aab.mp3", "I write a short note and keep all my notes in a notebook.": "audio/cau/26f4f6be6ec1126c.mp3", "Did you notice her new haircut?": "audio/cau/f0ec69a680ab4edb.mp3", "Read the notice on the board.": "audio/cau/decda91337e8460e.mp3", "I am doing my homework now.": "audio/cau/c512289bbb165978.mp3", "It is raining now, so we stay at home.": "audio/cau/ac1b5a1cae28deb6.mp3", "The Pacific Ocean is the biggest ocean.": "audio/cau/3173e229089548be.mp3", "Plastic waste goes into the sea and then the ocean.": "audio/cau/7d40b32c72996455.mp3", "Circle the odd one out in each group.": "audio/cau/d913119ae4b221f5.mp3", "One, three and five are odd numbers; two is even.": "audio/cau/3dfaeb173a42dfc3.mp3", "He was dressed oddly today.": "audio/cau/fd3eb9eae6386d92.mp3", "Oddly, nobody answered the phone.": "audio/cau/7b42a966994e1091.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "My brother is older than me.": "audio/cau/5670535468e3c19f.mp3", "This house is old, but that house is older.": "audio/cau/854d4f823994b96e.mp3", "This is the oldest pagoda in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/112d241056ccf384.mp3", "My grandpa is the oldest in my family.": "audio/cau/9f9847641a26a88e.mp3", "Please open your books to page twenty.": "audio/cau/53593951c79684b4.mp3", "Open the window, but close the door.": "audio/cau/7aa87d369a509fca.mp3", "Get enough sleep every night; otherwise, your health will suffer.": "audio/cau/88349a162c32012c.mp3", "Wear a coat; otherwise, you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/58a979e859eb4708.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The city has many outdoor markets.": "audio/cau/70f031e665dcb6a3.mp3", "Phong likes outdoor sports, so he often plays outdoors.": "audio/cau/62d7cb3e1f835b37.mp3", "My friends and I like playing outdoors.": "audio/cau/b93328230ef90e2f.mp3", "It's sunny today, so let's eat our lunch outdoors.": "audio/cau/5f24f91daf666c75.mp3", "We live on the outskirts of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/9bbed0018ca4edef.mp3", "The factory is on the outskirts of town.": "audio/cau/f1d502851dc7d127.mp3", "He overcame many difficulties to finish school.": "audio/cau/e2eeb96a2ddecade.mp3", "She overcame her fear, and now she can overcome any problem.": "audio/cau/ed2b5305f9424c84.mp3", "We can overcome problems if we work together.": "audio/cau/cd884a18810c97e7.mp3", "Minh overcame his shyness and gave a great talk.": "audio/cau/39e668579b99d45b.mp3", "Many young people want to study overseas.": "audio/cau/c73b68b3c6e8d679.mp3", "Hoa's brother works overseas and calls home every week.": "audio/cau/8bcc76445c1627f3.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "I like to paint pictures of flowers.": "audio/cau/f44d6f9b195d10c6.mp3", "We paint the house before Tet.": "audio/cau/d0f71b5285157539.mp3", "Read the first paragraph and answer the question.": "audio/cau/43e8d58106b6726a.mp3", "Write a short paragraph of about 80 words.": "audio/cau/79fc537e0a2633c9.mp3", "Mai and Lan swap paragraphs and check them.": "audio/cau/8ce60ddee9a706f4.mp3", "Minh writes two paragraphs about his daily routine.": "audio/cau/cfa99a15b21c6270.mp3", "We often play in the park after school.": "audio/cau/8d37e1ca664dbf08.mp3", "Dad parks his motorbike near the park gate.": "audio/cau/54a831b26aaf5a2e.mp3", "There is no parking in front of the school.": "audio/cau/45a4f0e590ae10d8.mp3", "My uncle parks his car in the car park.": "audio/cau/466290d5862f73a2.mp3", "This part of the lesson is about friends.": "audio/cau/fe137d473624dc0c.mp3", "We take part in the game, and it is partly about music.": "audio/cau/f86fd833e90206a2.mp3", "It will be partly cloudy tomorrow.": "audio/cau/2e9279ced890cd59.mp3", "The story is partly true.": "audio/cau/a56a321d8dcb3386.mp3", "The lesson has three parts.": "audio/cau/1b1d9c097e2f0ab4.mp3", "Name the parts of the face: eyes, nose and mouth.": "audio/cau/1959d4fcb37c5b1b.mp3", "There are two reading passages in the test.": "audio/cau/baf48040c2d24f97.mp3", "Read the passages carefully.": "audio/cau/fbb84e7addf8ef7d.mp3", "Everyone wants peace in the world.": "audio/cau/7491ecb0cd9d5164.mp3", "I like the peace of the countryside.": "audio/cau/1a9d1d69992b48c6.mp3", "The village is quiet and peaceful, not noisy like the city.": "audio/cau/c7f81daa39689185.mp3", "The baby is sleeping peacefully.": "audio/cau/eb86ccf5ad0e8214.mp3", "People live peacefully in the village.": "audio/cau/c22dbd799ffc67fb.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "The water puppet performance was great.": "audio/cau/b8c77e7b78348ac2.mp3", "His performance at school is getting better.": "audio/cau/ed3ef763648322ef.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is my personal diary.": "audio/cau/4bb512632de09306.mp3", "Don't share personal information online.": "audio/cau/e4de8d484708e9e5.mp3", "Hoa has a friendly personality.": "audio/cau/5e968c0ca289e9bb.mp3", "Minh has a strong character and a kind personality.": "audio/cau/e35df7bcc2cd6179.mp3", "Personally, I prefer reading books.": "audio/cau/9aa0346277f99977.mp3", "The head teacher personally thanked us.": "audio/cau/46dcede164b9a7eb.mp3", "Ha Noi is famous for pho.": "audio/cau/1b6e7f5d91eff0e4.mp3", "We often eat beef pho for breakfast.": "audio/cau/c8b792374af6b6ec.mp3", "Pick a card, please.": "audio/cau/1e4e9d51e347aede.mp3", "We pick tea leaves in the morning.": "audio/cau/c487a2bfd0d8d890.mp3", "My uncle picked us up at the bus station.": "audio/cau/b0c8e2d47baf7115.mp3", "Lan picked some flowers in the garden.": "audio/cau/ce45c98795b6b9e7.mp3", "Can I have a piece of paper?": "audio/cau/a721b0473c8251c5.mp3", "Lan cuts the cake into eight pieces.": "audio/cau/8d015d96c4090b95.mp3", "Here are some pieces of advice for teens.": "audio/cau/31c475374fcd7ee5.mp3", "Eat a piece of fruit, not three pieces of cake.": "audio/cau/011558a866e5d41a.mp3", "Nam and Phong play football after school.": "audio/cau/4f990530a36010eb.mp3", "The children play in the playground at break time.": "audio/cau/01c38c5563b4ece0.mp3", "He is a good football player.": "audio/cau/2592e456810d1a0e.mp3", "Each player has three cards.": "audio/cau/2733b581f437ad82.mp3", "My puppy is very playful.": "audio/cau/2a941a50bd420b1b.mp3", "She has a playful smile.": "audio/cau/f0b4790d33181781.mp3", "The children play football in the playground.": "audio/cau/ba97d8ec376ab1f4.mp3", "Lan and Hoa play games in the school playground.": "audio/cau/16841dfb20eb6b7d.mp3", "Phong is playing football with his friends.": "audio/cau/fd009e447f675c7d.mp3", "Mi likes playing chess, and she is a good player.": "audio/cau/4637524c7f8926bf.mp3", "This singer is popular with teenagers.": "audio/cau/fdbd5fd7ebddf922.mp3", "Football is the most popular sport in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/a567791eb72955db.mp3", "The game's popularity is growing.": "audio/cau/126119d057896ab4.mp3", "K-pop has great popularity in Vietnam.": "audio/cau/edcc5616984001a4.mp3", "Each group will present their project to the class.": "audio/cau/6116c3864aebd817.mp3", "Hoa presented her project about her grandfather.": "audio/cau/199806383df2605a.mp3", "Our group gave a presentation about a famous person.": "audio/cau/19eabc250c35918d.mp3", "Minh presents the first part of the presentation.": "audio/cau/97ffec456b1ba8a6.mp3", "She is a TV presenter.": "audio/cau/12a3eb4b246723e1.mp3", "The presenter asked many questions.": "audio/cau/cf8a5c5982b7bec0.mp3", "She has a pretty face.": "audio/cau/b4057ea8bc4143dd.mp3", "The test was pretty easy.": "audio/cau/c3222808c2b9263e.mp3", "My favourite TV programme is on at 8.": "audio/cau/36028f8073ccd137.mp3", "The school has an exchange programme.": "audio/cau/da61eabb35538c0b.mp3", "I like cartoon programmes.": "audio/cau/2c3014a89f316339.mp3", "There are many good programmes for kids.": "audio/cau/57404dbb7bf31570.mp3", "Pull the door to open it.": "audio/cau/9309601c0672fc19.mp3", "The horse pulls the cart.": "audio/cau/87242600c3f741dc.mp3", "Push the door to open it.": "audio/cau/878f53a6edb23464.mp3", "Don't pull the door. Push it!": "audio/cau/5574db583a85fca2.mp3", "Can I ask you a question, Ms Hoa?": "audio/cau/7e99e348210556f2.mp3", "Nam asks a question, and Mi gives the answer.": "audio/cau/269c53bfb0db8e6f.mp3", "Please fill in the questionnaire.": "audio/cau/a95121e3928b213d.mp3", "We did a questionnaire about hobbies.": "audio/cau/c390090db32f59d5.mp3", "The teacher asks us three questions.": "audio/cau/9e7c27a7a37e13a0.mp3", "Read the questions carefully and write your answers.": "audio/cau/7fcc03272c2a6124.mp3", "Let's have a quick look at the poster.": "audio/cau/74f69b26a440762a.mp3", "Nam is a quick learner, so he learns quickly.": "audio/cau/5e11bac22bdaf305.mp3", "She quickly became famous.": "audio/cau/69d2407f5c23a407.mp3", "Minh walks quickly, but his brother walks slowly.": "audio/cau/df1476232b08c52c.mp3", "The library is a quiet place.": "audio/cau/cf5d391e8e881e58.mp3", "My village is quieter and more peaceful than the city.": "audio/cau/fe9afae0f73f7b97.mp3", "Please speak quietly in the library.": "audio/cau/d3d8ecfcd2451005.mp3", "She closed the door quietly.": "audio/cau/ca20754f99efde5b.mp3", "I love the quietness of the countryside.": "audio/cau/13091db4624edf0a.mp3", "The quietness helped me study.": "audio/cau/b9d1231d026f5544.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "I ran to school this morning.": "audio/cau/a3532416f69a38c4.mp3", "The dog ran after the cat.": "audio/cau/5fe931832127affe.mp3", "We can reach the city centre by bus.": "audio/cau/04ff8a28c2c1ea1e.mp3", "The bus line doesn't reach my village yet.": "audio/cau/7e34175d758a85c7.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "He recovered quickly from the flu.": "audio/cau/b8f15ccf3aed7092.mp3", "I hope you recover soon.": "audio/cau/f5c743f482dbdbfb.mp3", "I relax by reading books at weekends.": "audio/cau/7a14312dbb4ab728.mp3", "After school, I listen to music to relax.": "audio/cau/cb3ed8bfdce9e8f8.mp3", "Music is good for relaxation.": "audio/cau/00f61d33b157afba.mp3", "I read books for relaxation.": "audio/cau/6f32318faf672d5d.mp3", "Walking in the morning makes us feel relaxed.": "audio/cau/8a55a52b63802535.mp3", "Hoa feels relaxed after listening to music.": "audio/cau/a280c4ce5593c872.mp3", "Please remain in your seats.": "audio/cau/a69a901e69682f29.mp3", "The weather will remain hot.": "audio/cau/e5c6ac18b5424f3e.mp3", "She replied to my email.": "audio/cau/2fbd94e9b5184829.mp3", "'Yes,' he replied.": "audio/cau/1184cff77b7797c5.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "Report your group's ideas to the class.": "audio/cau/6522433ccfce4976.mp3", "The reporter wrote a report about our village.": "audio/cau/136adff9e04b464a.mp3", "The reporter asked many questions.": "audio/cau/3220169670e28ec1.mp3", "She wants to be a TV reporter.": "audio/cau/d6499b08f001431b.mp3", "If you don't feel well, you can stay at home and rest.": "audio/cau/80c50d7bcdc0aa2e.mp3", "Hoa rests for ten minutes after running.": "audio/cau/0e4d9ca9b895f037.mp3", "Restart your computer.": "audio/cau/b7d451ba5c736617.mp3", "We will restart the game after lunch.": "audio/cau/f73484ffdfba2234.mp3", "We had a restful weekend.": "audio/cau/5b74bff45779c503.mp3", "The garden is very restful.": "audio/cau/3998112657f9d2d2.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "She rightly said no.": "audio/cau/0716d99ea752c0a9.mp3", "He was rightly proud of his work.": "audio/cau/82f83dc7701970f6.mp3", "This road is busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/84aea104087d60d6.mp3", "The roads in the city are often crowded.": "audio/cau/f4720f3bd15cb73a.mp3", "This road is wide, but other roads are narrow.": "audio/cau/6df87d5b47381d5e.mp3", "The ball rolled under the table.": "audio/cau/acb1287e6b190e64.mp3", "Roll the paper into a tube.": "audio/cau/c26ce2cca1b66531.mp3", "The ball is rolling down the hill.": "audio/cau/890bd9f82a0d05cd.mp3", "She is rolling spring rolls.": "audio/cau/01eef0441f1b3a55.mp3", "The table in our living room is round.": "audio/cau/f7f856ccb720a89e.mp3", "The Earth is round like a ball.": "audio/cau/bb61c7563d06ea8c.mp3", "I run in the park every morning.": "audio/cau/3fed1cc1643c52ce.mp3", "Mi ran very fast; she is a good runner.": "audio/cau/48f4e8245e306883.mp3", "She is a fast runner.": "audio/cau/afd8441159114afa.mp3", "The runners are ready.": "audio/cau/54ebdd7ec5915c37.mp3", "The children are running in the schoolyard.": "audio/cau/cd547a363770b5c2.mp3", "Nam loves running, and he ran five kilometres today.": "audio/cau/f921a02636522e0b.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "I said, can you pass me the book?": "audio/cau/e2db7c41d720581d.mp3", "The teacher said we should sleep early.": "audio/cau/f9528b768b823292.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "I saw a beautiful rainbow yesterday afternoon.": "audio/cau/87d8e8a9aa1c8cb1.mp3", "We saw many animals at the zoo.": "audio/cau/bf15ca1e43e22b9a.mp3", "What do you say when you meet someone?": "audio/cau/ebd766cb7a0b37c7.mp3", "Say hello! Mi said hello to everyone.": "audio/cau/835b6b164eec79c4.mp3", "What is the artisan saying about his work?": "audio/cau/758a63f41cdaea82.mp3", "Grandpa said an old saying about hard work.": "audio/cau/dae1465b6bed02a4.mp3", "Lan is my schoolmate, not my classmate.": "audio/cau/e2d3147caa8ce83b.mp3", "I met a schoolmate at the bookshop.": "audio/cau/600fe95b9cf0ba63.mp3", "My grandparents' house is near the sea.": "audio/cau/acd2af1fe0d48aed.mp3", "We swim in the sea in summer.": "audio/cau/a658c72373cebc53.mp3", "Can you see the picture on page ten?": "audio/cau/505d4b7b963a3756.mp3", "I saw Lan yesterday, and I'll see her tomorrow.": "audio/cau/d14cce6b0cd0e6db.mp3", "You seem very tired today, Nam.": "audio/cau/35d0d317c3b0474d.mp3", "The test seems easy, but be careful.": "audio/cau/464d526b15ed996d.mp3", "Have you seen the new market in town?": "audio/cau/0689eb245aec2ebc.mp3", "Yes, I have seen it; I saw it last week.": "audio/cau/476814d0d69a0131.mp3", "Select the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/fa11d36a6784e8b9.mp3", "She selected a red dress for the party.": "audio/cau/949a496976983bca.mp3", "Air pollution is a serious problem.": "audio/cau/451a7484a9226374.mp3", "Our teacher looks serious today.": "audio/cau/128bbd7598114bcd.mp3", "There's a shelf next to the bed.": "audio/cau/2ff12f0ee8c17812.mp3", "My books are on the shelf.": "audio/cau/85f866544d3e129e.mp3", "Let's go to the shop to buy a lamp.": "audio/cau/02d8310bb74af7bc.mp3", "There is a small shop near my house.": "audio/cau/e63a93ab9fc8033d.mp3", "Show your photos to the class.": "audio/cau/2238dc578e393ea6.mp3", "Nam showed us photos of his village.": "audio/cau/212c93e8427b7095.mp3", "The artisan showed us how to make lanterns.": "audio/cau/897188b380de15ca.mp3", "Please show me too; you showed Mi yesterday.": "audio/cau/f493ef15d21acfbb.mp3", "The film is shown on TV tonight.": "audio/cau/75e35008646b299e.mp3", "She has shown me her new room.": "audio/cau/d93aaba1ebaa7897.mp3", "The timeline shows the important events in his life.": "audio/cau/842231fd94ad1d43.mp3", "This photo shows my grandfather as a young man.": "audio/cau/f9a1966a7b553101.mp3", "Please shut the door behind you.": "audio/cau/e6715fb5ffbc0de9.mp3", "The shop shuts at nine o'clock.": "audio/cau/46d348eb4a2e1b29.mp3", "There are trees on both sides of the road.": "audio/cau/f143b07fb9a6df16.mp3", "A square has four sides.": "audio/cau/ab9f343508c0a756.mp3", "My grandpa has poor sight.": "audio/cau/5906c0adbcad9b65.mp3", "The sunset over the sea is a beautiful sight.": "audio/cau/39836f836f67a5ef.mp3", "We went sightseeing in Da Lat.": "audio/cau/7b2dda7cb10c2f4d.mp3", "Sightseeing by bike is fun and cheap.": "audio/cau/15f3a16f3ed0403b.mp3", "Please work in silence during the test.": "audio/cau/a7f626c54a6524f3.mp3", "There was silence in the room.": "audio/cau/809df2d322bd51e7.mp3", "Life in my city is similar to life in yours.": "audio/cau/b89b4fb5bd2e62ee.mp3", "Hoa and Lan look similar, but their hobbies are different.": "audio/cau/612906abb392c0a7.mp3", "There is a similarity between the two stories.": "audio/cau/5e7f0978e1ff716e.mp3", "I see a similarity between you and your mum.": "audio/cau/6cf9435c1f3a000c.mp3", "The two sisters dress similarly.": "audio/cau/5e58452bd7fa9e2e.mp3", "Similarly, we should save electricity at school.": "audio/cau/124a6e7eba967203.mp3", "Use simple words in your presentation.": "audio/cau/685b89e962568275.mp3", "The task is simple; simply read and answer.": "audio/cau/f9dad5cdcce61ac9.mp3", "I like the simplicity of country life.": "audio/cau/223291143abc868a.mp3", "The game is popular because of its simplicity.": "audio/cau/815ee12f88667bff.mp3", "Can you simplify this sentence for me?": "audio/cau/2b468cda6c75aaee.mp3", "Pictures can simplify difficult ideas.": "audio/cau/601a75c83728a5fa.mp3", "Please explain it simply.": "audio/cau/e04f47837a9ba1d7.mp3", "It is simply too hot to go out.": "audio/cau/048b878e79e74d88.mp3", "The bus is slow at rush hour.": "audio/cau/732f025c97062de8.mp3", "Drivers should slow down near the school gate.": "audio/cau/80ba3032c253c920.mp3", "Please speak slowly so I can understand.": "audio/cau/68b132e808a46997.mp3", "The old man walked slowly to the bus stop.": "audio/cau/87e81f4cf164cdf1.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "My village is smaller than the city.": "audio/cau/77ad0931648736fe.mp3", "This shop is small, but that one is even smaller.": "audio/cau/0d67ec98fa2886f3.mp3", "This is the smallest room in the house.": "audio/cau/be5f404374212531.mp3", "Vatican City is the smallest country in the world.": "audio/cau/df407ba4f28abf48.mp3", "The snake goes \"sss\".": "audio/cau/454b133f55dcd972.mp3", "There is a green snake in the garden.": "audio/cau/505dbd6a4ebdee69.mp3", "Which word has the sound /əʊ/?": "audio/cau/abdd497b61506cce.mp3", "I love the sound of the rain at night.": "audio/cau/6a34a72a03c00f3a.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "She is a good English speaker.": "audio/cau/ad8983e10a3153eb.mp3", "Turn up the speaker, please.": "audio/cau/176c25890d4baf0b.mp3", "Our head teacher gave a short speech today.": "audio/cau/d7f9999a0661fac2.mp3", "Mi will speak first, then Nam will give his speech.": "audio/cau/e7405c38166acf2a.mp3", "She spoke English very well.": "audio/cau/021d27ba9b445e58.mp3", "I spoke to my teacher after class.": "audio/cau/8a7ed13ad52bfd30.mp3", "English is spoken in many countries.": "audio/cau/0ddaddfdf518ec9f.mp3", "Have you spoken to Nam yet?": "audio/cau/8c0ca43c0de90d55.mp3", "Minh is very sporty; he plays sport every day.": "audio/cau/8f3a07ca267912a7.mp3", "My favourite sports are football and swimming.": "audio/cau/8a24f3303ec53899.mp3", "Badminton is a popular sport, and Nam loves all sports.": "audio/cau/76b12d75a3439875.mp3", "My sister is sporty and plays volleyball.": "audio/cau/e6b11ca23dbab79b.mp3", "Phong is sporty, so his favourite sport is football.": "audio/cau/4d26845d5c555def.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "My grandfather started work when he was fifteen.": "audio/cau/9cd956a07a50d11d.mp3", "The film started at seven and finished at nine.": "audio/cau/7b234820845db47a.mp3", "We had spring rolls as a starter.": "audio/cau/28024f2227f60323.mp3", "Would you like a starter?": "audio/cau/547893b9dae758e2.mp3", "School starts at seven in the morning.": "audio/cau/2ed9e4687c39729d.mp3", "The class starts at two and finishes at four.": "audio/cau/1e53c824b44db25c.mp3", "Good sleep keeps you in a healthy state.": "audio/cau/7049cd3c8f8cac73.mp3", "Exercise can improve your state of mind.": "audio/cau/694d7b4b952786de.mp3", "Read the statements and choose True or False.": "audio/cau/5f41d85ba1cc95cf.mp3", "The principal made a statement about the trip.": "audio/cau/9ca8f7090ffddefd.mp3", "We stay in tents at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/2e09709e31b8333c.mp3", "Mi will stay at home, but Nam will leave early.": "audio/cau/d5c48ac441b0c097.mp3", "Lan stays with her grandmother on Sundays.": "audio/cau/b44c1a677410d319.mp3", "He usually stays at home, but last week he stayed with us.": "audio/cau/066aab773dd2f3f9.mp3", "Please stop talking and listen to me.": "audio/cau/14d99e9f18d5a441.mp3", "The bus will stop here and then start again.": "audio/cau/2af4e67bdadcfda0.mp3", "The bus stopped in front of the school.": "audio/cau/121db3ca5d4e994b.mp3", "It stopped raining in the afternoon.": "audio/cau/9b86f76370ef8bd0.mp3", "The bus stops near my school.": "audio/cau/8ca0fa7b47e949e9.mp3", "The rain stops at noon; yesterday it stopped at night.": "audio/cau/ec05a22dec30b00a.mp3", "My grandma is a great storyteller.": "audio/cau/5e7c88fb2310eebf.mp3", "The storyteller made the children laugh.": "audio/cau/3b52a1dad829ac46.mp3", "I heard a strange noise last night.": "audio/cau/a1184ef7d4830b99.mp3", "It is strange; a stranger is standing at our door.": "audio/cau/e420ba4fe0b0dab9.mp3", "He was acting strangely today.": "audio/cau/f61d6bd5b32d195d.mp3", "Strangely, nobody heard the noise.": "audio/cau/819cd49ccf70e162.mp3", "A stranger asks you the way to the bus station.": "audio/cau/188ee49bf13aafe8.mp3", "Minh helped a stranger find the bus stop.": "audio/cau/0799a86995ed9f59.mp3", "There are many shops on this street.": "audio/cau/3f780db4db7c5418.mp3", "Lan loves street food in the Old Quarter.": "audio/cau/88f07584eb11353e.mp3", "The streets in Ha Noi are busy at rush hour.": "audio/cau/9d135f4e1e753d49.mp3", "This street is quiet, but the other streets are noisy.": "audio/cau/ef9a487276d660b4.mp3", "Turn on the English subtitle, please.": "audio/cau/05a13efc24091c94.mp3", "This subtitle is too small to read.": "audio/cau/63ad2fc79e804836.mp3", "My uncle lives in a quiet suburb of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/de77851cc3a0a335.mp3", "Life in the suburb is quieter than in the city centre.": "audio/cau/e45ac8f499147469.mp3", "They live in a quiet suburban area.": "audio/cau/27cb35b4e0752c95.mp3", "Suburban houses often have gardens.": "audio/cau/6e8da80773a75e47.mp3", "Many families move to the suburbs for more space.": "audio/cau/d55d207df96c9b07.mp3", "My school is in the city centre, but I live in the suburbs.": "audio/cau/a6150b961a8dbd3b.mp3", "We often go to the beach in summer.": "audio/cau/3330dd1c522a12fd.mp3", "Summer is hot, but winter is cold in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ed399e7b44a56a6e.mp3", "We go to the beach in summertime.": "audio/cau/fa6081d52f2fb65f.mp3", "Summertime is my favourite time of year.": "audio/cau/847b3355d84b4bfe.mp3", "Friends support each other in hard times.": "audio/cau/c25544ac51cf812c.mp3", "My parents are supportive; they always support me.": "audio/cau/bc09957a4f6cc0ae.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "This photo was taken in Hue.": "audio/cau/f504f1fe8bdf2bf6.mp3", "Have you taken your medicine?": "audio/cau/28798ff67a8368e9.mp3", "Mi is taking photos of the flowers.": "audio/cau/13a0bae7bf3bc40c.mp3", "We are taking a bus now; we took a train last week.": "audio/cau/5e43700c2b0ef208.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My little sister is very talkative.": "audio/cau/abe6afbd7c67a621.mp3", "He is shy, not talkative.": "audio/cau/c9c299a5fd04a0e9.mp3", "My brother is a teen, so he wants his own room.": "audio/cau/c8eb1ac059c2bb4a.mp3", "A teenager is a teen between thirteen and nineteen.": "audio/cau/d1532a0567e7f8bc.mp3", "Teenage students often use social media.": "audio/cau/6439a5aadf508eec.mp3", "She has two teenage sons.": "audio/cau/1b22257023981880.mp3", "Most teenagers like music and games.": "audio/cau/a9bbd7adccb33a47.mp3", "As a teenager, he loved football.": "audio/cau/64a6cc4e62c5025e.mp3", "They will televise the football match.": "audio/cau/fe8512575a4fbca8.mp3", "The festival is televised every year.": "audio/cau/9db88e86d5457ce7.mp3", "There is a television in the living room.": "audio/cau/b6e9f08b84a3491c.mp3", "My grandma watches television in the evening.": "audio/cau/405c173d0715402b.mp3", "Please tell me about your hometown.": "audio/cau/d5098eae824e03fa.mp3", "My grandpa told me a story last night.": "audio/cau/ba19b792ce3534dc.mp3", "We visited the Temple of Literature in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/165f1d51889bb5d4.mp3", "My grandma goes to the temple on the first day of the month.": "audio/cau/e3b2716af636431f.mp3", "Hue has many old temples.": "audio/cau/fd860d9b8887b057.mp3", "Tourists visit the temples of Angkor.": "audio/cau/c1b6592287602c26.mp3", "The traffic in the city is terrible today.": "audio/cau/01ea841928344884.mp3", "The food was terrible, but the view was wonderful.": "audio/cau/93b659e2b5f66a2e.mp3", "I'm terribly sorry for being late.": "audio/cau/32ca42d4f80bdb0d.mp3", "He sang terribly at the party.": "audio/cau/812ab7cd1e974ecb.mp3", "Thank you for your help.": "audio/cau/f1b6ff2034f49180.mp3", "I want to thank my teacher; I am thankful to her.": "audio/cau/e425280c59f568bd.mp3", "We are thankful to the people in our community.": "audio/cau/223a6b926026e8db.mp3", "I am thankful for your help, so I thank you a lot.": "audio/cau/6f44905722dacb4f.mp3", "Thankfully, nobody was hurt.": "audio/cau/7bd5f8cb0cb1f3b1.mp3", "Thankfully, the rain stopped before the match.": "audio/cau/80e95fd617deb78b.mp3", "I had breakfast, and then I went to school.": "audio/cau/e707895b95dcb0e6.mp3", "First, wash the rice. Next, cook it. Then, eat it.": "audio/cau/2bb6330c0be506ed.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "Thirdly, we should save water.": "audio/cau/a368bc621a56c1a0.mp3", "Thirdly, exercise keeps you healthy.": "audio/cau/5e62888bdcf24d9a.mp3", "It was thoughtful of you to bring me flowers.": "audio/cau/baaadaf968d1f491.mp3", "My grandmother is a thoughtful person.": "audio/cau/a52bbd2ea31bf2b4.mp3", "I was thrilled to win the prize.": "audio/cau/bdb358259efea1f4.mp3", "The children were thrilled with their gifts.": "audio/cau/448715896fc5f54f.mp3", "It was a thrilling football match.": "audio/cau/116ede8489033537.mp3", "We watched a thrilling film last night.": "audio/cau/f5abe0ab3d608764.mp3", "Tick the correct answers.": "audio/cau/03211fde6b6a3087.mp3", "Put a tick next to the things you did.": "audio/cau/579b575a47a252d1.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "Mum opened a tin of fish.": "audio/cau/5e651202e8c5abce.mp3", "We recycle old tins at school.": "audio/cau/d4330e1cfd8f5ea3.mp3", "What is the best title for the text?": "audio/cau/ab4d19ae5334140f.mp3", "The title of the song is very short.": "audio/cau/d45d206bcd3678e3.mp3", "Today is Monday, and I have maths.": "audio/cau/a2c1db38d6bad1f7.mp3", "It is sunny today, so we play outside.": "audio/cau/43f448f8abe01280.mp3", "I hurt my toe when I played football.": "audio/cau/299297371fb5eff4.mp3", "Babies have tiny toes.": "audio/cau/fc2fd6d151dd627e.mp3", "I have ten toes on my feet.": "audio/cau/9eafe57834b1ce35.mp3", "Mi hurt her toe, so her toes are red.": "audio/cau/09ce0bd120419f08.mp3", "We worked together on the project.": "audio/cau/69b6290ba4ffa803.mp3", "They live together, but Minh lives alone.": "audio/cau/48beeee1f86eeeb3.mp3", "Tet is a time of family togetherness.": "audio/cau/268732695cf162ce.mp3", "Team games build togetherness.": "audio/cau/a09a1be0bee3a124.mp3", "My grandma told me a funny story.": "audio/cau/f87f67862f96ec79.mp3", "The teacher told us to be quiet.": "audio/cau/42fba1ee1bbe34c4.mp3", "Lan is going to bed early tonight.": "audio/cau/082a4a419bcc862e.mp3", "If you stay up late tonight, you might feel tired tomorrow.": "audio/cau/67679aa3684d9212.mp3", "I like swimming, and my sister likes it too.": "audio/cau/695ee0e76ca64b23.mp3", "This tea is too hot; I also want some water.": "audio/cau/641c64a35c7075e8.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "My top priority this week is the English test.": "audio/cau/8193cd55a97916bf.mp3", "Homework is Mai's top priority after school.": "audio/cau/3fb4be7e1f965a3d.mp3", "The total cost of the trip was two million dong.": "audio/cau/521a6863d757906b.mp3", "We have thirty students in total.": "audio/cau/668ad1ace50950a6.mp3", "I totally agree with you.": "audio/cau/2ed025b410dc2507.mp3", "The town is totally different now; it changed completely.": "audio/cau/7c44b917714a1ef2.mp3", "We went on a tour of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/b1aef3993b1d87cd.mp3", "The bus tour starts at 8 a.m.": "audio/cau/dd11943cd2068c0b.mp3", "Tourism is important to Da Nang.": "audio/cau/66c18d8036dc4cca.mp3", "Eco-tourism helps protect nature.": "audio/cau/e2cac58b1dc37552.mp3", "A tourist asked me the way to the lake.": "audio/cau/85504a3dd570c415.mp3", "Tourism is important, and every tourist loves our pho.": "audio/cau/28ec58cef47dd36f.mp3", "Many tourists visit Hoi An every year.": "audio/cau/34e133dcd9a0fdd4.mp3", "The market attracts tourists and locals.": "audio/cau/4d4408900393fd12.mp3", "I live in a small town near the sea.": "audio/cau/d1834f8b57570cad.mp3", "My town is bigger than my grandparents' village.": "audio/cau/5dce2eb178b20c1e.mp3", "I want to travel around Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/0750a29d21b5efe2.mp3", "He travelled a lot; he was a real traveller.": "audio/cau/4dcdae3874eeaed4.mp3", "My grandfather travelled to many countries.": "audio/cau/107d8288b9a40c84.mp3", "She loves to travel and travelled to Sa Pa last year.": "audio/cau/93e220e8766f6d22.mp3", "She is an experienced traveller.": "audio/cau/29eb7abc2f370ce9.mp3", "The traveller asked me the way to the station.": "audio/cau/1fa099e8b22dabff.mp3", "My dad travels to work by bus.": "audio/cau/177c644b9aece081.mp3", "Lan travels by bike now, but she travelled by bus before.": "audio/cau/7f9d93f4968cc393.mp3", "I tried to accomplish my goal of cycling five kilometres a day.": "audio/cau/3db6bdb7b910b612.mp3", "Hoa tried to finish her homework early.": "audio/cau/1e93b2dcd428c99f.mp3", "Our class went on a trip to Ba Vi last week.": "audio/cau/49052bb2aa4887c3.mp3", "The school trip was fun, and Minh enjoyed the journey.": "audio/cau/4af60768714d1058.mp3", "The summer camp has field trips every day.": "audio/cau/8cf58a9d85707783.mp3", "Mi likes school trips; her favourite trip was to Ha Long Bay.": "audio/cau/60fdb111b29b8d59.mp3", "Let's try this new game, Nam!": "audio/cau/9540039a577e2fee.mp3", "Hoa tried hard, and she didn't give up.": "audio/cau/deeed17a1fca8206.mp3", "Go straight and turn left at the corner.": "audio/cau/917966b2ec32c8a4.mp3", "A farm can turn food waste into biogas.": "audio/cau/52db34b37521af50.mp3", "This project turns food waste into energy.": "audio/cau/120924f8388b4ad5.mp3", "We turned old bottles into flower pots.": "audio/cau/36df7dee09156ada.mp3", "There is a big TV in our living room.": "audio/cau/12dac61f7442af7c.mp3", "Nam watches TV after dinner, and his television is new.": "audio/cau/f8c696f4133477c5.mp3", "The more rubbish there is, the uglier the city becomes.": "audio/cau/40b42b7b9a1766fc.mp3", "This old building is ugly, but that one is even uglier.": "audio/cau/88d3dbf1154e8f0f.mp3", "The ugliness of the rubbish shocked us.": "audio/cau/1d39b5ddc3d3e0e3.mp3", "Beauty and ugliness are in the eye of the viewer.": "audio/cau/7b7da2fd6065d419.mp3", "The street looks ugly with all that rubbish.": "audio/cau/84027adc63b4f048.mp3", "The park was ugly before, but now it is beautiful.": "audio/cau/133c40c5a01388aa.mp3", "The old building looks unattractive.": "audio/cau/b241d830f1297168.mp3", "This plan is unattractive to young people.": "audio/cau/170c7efc82bb758c.mp3", "Don't be uncaring to your friends.": "audio/cau/04bee2cbc921dc0a.mp3", "He seemed cold and uncaring.": "audio/cau/d166d31db07821d4.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has some underground metro stations.": "audio/cau/fd268956dce8144e.mp3", "We took the underground to the city centre.": "audio/cau/8022bdb95be3059a.mp3", "I have some unfinished homework.": "audio/cau/b859e4ceb45620e6.mp3", "The painting is still unfinished.": "audio/cau/5b61ced64860e8a6.mp3", "The new neighbour seems unfriendly.": "audio/cau/0e1c5a5441788b1d.mp3", "Don't be unfriendly to new classmates.": "audio/cau/6506d305aef12ce1.mp3", "Don't be ungrateful to your parents.": "audio/cau/972d682898dd93a4.mp3", "The ungrateful boy didn't say thank you.": "audio/cau/1b786f8c43c1aa81.mp3", "The shop assistant was unhelpful.": "audio/cau/72e4a1fc9b333f47.mp3", "This map is unhelpful.": "audio/cau/a647e15849c7448e.mp3", "He is uninterested in sports.": "audio/cau/c861b97da9e2e85f.mp3", "The students looked uninterested.": "audio/cau/26cb7f657950d3cc.mp3", "The film was long and uninteresting.": "audio/cau/fe255bc43d0bc7d1.mp3", "Nothing is uninteresting if you look closely.": "audio/cau/fbd9a81d434e40b7.mp3", "It's unkind to laugh at others.": "audio/cau/192d5bf86ba98a81.mp3", "She said some unkind words.": "audio/cau/47391550bf40693a.mp3", "The writer of this song is unknown.": "audio/cau/34fd2674ae6ed3a3.mp3", "They travelled to unknown places.": "audio/cau/d5bf3d5c45b79db6.mp3", "The new rule is unpopular with students.": "audio/cau/0273c12663516408.mp3", "This game is unpopular now.": "audio/cau/6dc0deb47558dd88.mp3", "It's unusual to see snow in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e05b05b1ff1ae1b4.mp3", "She has an unusual name.": "audio/cau/8b34ff4e430332df.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "Spend your free time usefully.": "audio/cau/a5f343473daf5755.mp3", "Old bottles can be used usefully as pots.": "audio/cau/f80325fc53a6f5a0.mp3", "We talked about the usefulness of the Internet.": "audio/cau/1fa0f0d5fcdf7de1.mp3", "The usefulness of this tool is clear.": "audio/cau/a1f35dfbac0c1e29.mp3", "This broken umbrella is useless.": "audio/cau/87f4d5c1e27eee06.mp3", "It's useless to cry now.": "audio/cau/d2efa23c3f23f8b7.mp3", "Facebook has millions of users.": "audio/cau/3955ede83592bd40.mp3", "Enter your user name here.": "audio/cau/8f967e17a7ac312d.mp3", "I got up at the usual time.": "audio/cau/290a01bde4a43987.mp3", "As usual, she was late.": "audio/cau/dbda02aadf09e9b8.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "Write the -ing form of these verbs.": "audio/cau/9a8d4d3f46f1577e.mp3", "'Run' and 'swim' are verbs; can you find one more verb?": "audio/cau/1cd8c87f9c695ab7.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "The villagers are very friendly.": "audio/cau/83b65e1cf54c314b.mp3", "A villager showed us the way.": "audio/cau/8c99ee2c847588ae.mp3", "There are many craft villages near Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/9064f8b48096eb71.mp3", "Bat Trang is a famous pottery village.": "audio/cau/7212e9943aa25d4c.mp3", "Visit our website for more information.": "audio/cau/ac9737600d9243d7.mp3", "Phong visited his grandparents, and they enjoyed his visit.": "audio/cau/24f2a12ad9734414.mp3", "Each visitor gets a free map.": "audio/cau/d13c12d782a36fe7.mp3", "Many visitors visit Hoi An every year.": "audio/cau/f97ffc3669fff0e8.mp3", "Bat Trang attracts many visitors.": "audio/cau/3b53ccd4a057d15e.mp3", "Visitors visit the craft village to buy pottery.": "audio/cau/364cd950cea318c5.mp3", "I walk to school every day.": "audio/cau/0a109a8251b16954.mp3", "Mi walked in the park and enjoyed her walk.": "audio/cau/f2ec11ed20a260e3.mp3", "My grandpa is a fast walker.": "audio/cau/ca50bebfe80aee78.mp3", "Walkers enjoy the park in the morning.": "audio/cau/d1fec283c01987ff.mp3", "It's warm today.": "audio/cau/cc0e8ca9006d57a2.mp3", "Wear a warm coat in winter.": "audio/cau/95aec6c826de01b5.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "We watch TV after dinner.": "audio/cau/8b47f4f4b321b7f8.mp3", "Nam is watching a film; his new watch is on the table.": "audio/cau/850cc4ddfbc726bf.mp3", "Trang watches films at the cinema at weekends.": "audio/cau/58771fac6bb56dc4.mp3", "My brother likes to watch football, and he watches it every Sunday.": "audio/cau/b5419c83106d199e.mp3", "They are watching a cartoon now.": "audio/cau/4d078d8c29b3de5f.mp3", "Phong likes watching football; he watches it every weekend.": "audio/cau/67283f87df189657.mp3", "This is the best way to learn new words.": "audio/cau/22b4d6bd5dcffca6.mp3", "Can you show me the way to the museum?": "audio/cau/a9eaac6ad2044743.mp3", "There are many ways to stay healthy.": "audio/cau/f79f902892e98e97.mp3", "Walking is a good way to keep fit.": "audio/cau/93a24eae327f3cdd.mp3", "What's the weather like today?": "audio/cau/967d9c636aaa6e59.mp3", "The weather is sunny and warm.": "audio/cau/8fdced42cdce5802.mp3", "Complete the word web with types of house.": "audio/cau/030471878c4c327d.mp3", "There is a spider's web in the garden.": "audio/cau/62f4eaf1ea13dd1c.mp3", "Nam made a website for his class.": "audio/cau/ce79a65c937dfd29.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Tuan tells a joke and the whole class laughs.": "audio/cau/72200be54ac56f1e.mp3", "We cleaned the whole house in one day.": "audio/cau/9e8c820037d2934c.mp3", "We go to the beach in summer, not in winter.": "audio/cau/6670734ed60f064d.mp3", "We had a wonderful holiday.": "audio/cau/b731d7b223c248dd.mp3", "What a wonderful idea!": "audio/cau/83d5b6cb831dd9a7.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "Would you like to live here?": "audio/cau/648fc211b3b7e91a.mp3", "I would like a villa with a big garden.": "audio/cau/af8db0397bcb6281.mp3", "Wrestling is popular at village festivals.": "audio/cau/45b91093ac727e98.mp3", "My cousin loves watching wrestling.": "audio/cau/855e5bf68976043b.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "He spelled my name wrongly.": "audio/cau/6f375b9c1ad0fc97.mp3", "She was wrongly blamed for the mistake.": "audio/cau/5c429e62a8f6c2c9.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "There are twelve months in a year.": "audio/cau/5ae786ad7493bc72.mp3", "This year, Mi is in Grade 9.": "audio/cau/6bad90fc27f44b2c.mp3", "The school has a yearly sports day.": "audio/cau/750d62eaf703f585.mp3", "We have a yearly health check.": "audio/cau/4c5595be96ba759a.mp3", "My sister is twelve years old.": "audio/cau/28db75637c65c4ff.mp3", "He worked there for five years before he moved to Hue.": "audio/cau/eee3be2c2ba96ad1.mp3", "My uncle is young and active.": "audio/cau/25ab8c1b23e804a5.mp3", "Nam is younger than Minh, but they are both young.": "audio/cau/ae83efbb6b4f31bc.mp3", "My younger brother is eight years old.": "audio/cau/4f32791e715fc8a4.mp3", "Lan is young, and her sister is even younger.": "audio/cau/a298d4fd339450fa.mp3", "I'm the youngest in my family.": "audio/cau/2b5949097bc49b2c.mp3", "She is the youngest student in the class.": "audio/cau/3af170b5e214d1ff.mp3", "My grandpa often talks about his youth.": "audio/cau/2cc4847b1b21067b.mp3", "The youth club meets on Saturdays.": "audio/cau/b613598b5b961ed0.mp3"};
